msgstr "Recipients can be supplied in two ways: repeat the same field multiple times, or separate them with commas within a single field."

msgid "收件人邮箱"
msgstr "Recipient Email"

msgid "收件人邮箱（必填，支持多个）"
msgstr "Recipient email (Required, multiple values supported)"

msgid "来自邮件列表的 id 字段"
msgstr "The id field from the mail list"

msgid "查询当前临时邮箱收到的邮件列表。"
msgstr "Get the list of emails received by the current temporary mailbox."

msgid "生成/复用临时邮箱并收取邮件；开放调用（免签名）。"
msgstr "Generate/reuse a temporary mailbox and receive emails; Open (No signature required)."

msgid "生成/获取临时邮箱"
msgstr "Generate/Get Temporary Mailbox"

msgid "生成一个临时邮箱地址（仅收信），返回邮箱地址与客户端标识。"
msgstr "Generate a temporary mailbox address (receive only) and return the address and the client ID."

msgid "生成一个全新临时邮箱，或凭 visitor_id 复用已有邮箱。"
msgstr "Generate a brand-new temporary mailbox, or reuse an existing one with visitor_id."

msgid "生成临时邮箱"
msgstr "Generate Temporary Mailbox"

msgid "留空自动生成 UUID"
msgstr "Leave empty to generate a UUID automatically"

msgid "获取可用域名列表"
msgstr "Get Available Domains"

msgid "获取当前可用的全部后缀域名，用于生成邮箱时指定 domain。"
msgstr "Get all currently available suffix domains, used to specify domain when generating a mailbox."

msgid "获取邮件列表"
msgstr "Get Email List"

msgid "获取邮件详情"
msgstr "Get Mail Detail"

msgid "访客标识"
msgstr "Visitor ID"

msgid "过期时间(分钟)"
msgstr "Expiry Time (minutes)"

msgid "返回 data 为域名字符串数组，如 [\"ddker.com\",\"9k3r.com\",\"uqu.me\"]；上游异常时返回内置默认域名，保证可用。"
msgstr "data is an array of domain strings such as ddker.com, 9k3r.com and uqu.me; on upstream failure the built-in default domains are returned so the service stays usable."

msgid "返回 data 为邮件摘要数组（id / from_name / from_email / subject / preview_text / preview_status / size / created_at）；完整正文用 id 查「获取邮件详情」。"
msgstr "data is an array of mail summaries (id / from_name / from_email / subject / preview_text / preview_status / size / created_at); use the id with Get Mail Detail for the full body."

msgid "返回 data 含 id / from / from_email / from_name / to / subject / text_body / html_body / attachments / date / created_at，以实际返回为准。"
msgstr "data contains id / from / from_email / from_name / to / subject / text_body / html_body / attachments / date / created_at; the actual response prevails."

msgid "返回 data：{address, domain, client_id}；address 为邮箱地址，client_id 建议保存并在后续查询邮件时回传。"
msgstr "data: {address, domain, client_id}; address is the mailbox address, and client_id should be saved and sent back when querying mail later."

msgid "选填：true 时强制生成新邮箱，原邮箱及其邮件将被丢弃"
msgstr "Optional: when true, force a new mailbox to be generated, discarding the original mailbox and its emails"

msgid "选填：不传则随机生成；传入已有值可复用有效期内邮箱"
msgstr "Optional: if omitted, a random value is generated; pass an existing value to reuse a mailbox within its validity period"

msgid "选填：与生成邮箱时的 client_id 保持一致"
msgstr "Optional: keep it the same as the client_id used when generating the mailbox"

msgid "选填：客户端标识（X-Client-ID）；不传由服务端随机生成，传已有值可复用同一身份"
msgstr "Optional: client identifier (X-Client-ID); if omitted the server generates one at random, and reusing an existing value reuses the same identity"

msgid "选填：指定后缀域名，缺省使用默认域名 uqu.me"
msgstr "Optional: specify the suffix domain; defaults to uqu.me"

msgid "选填：邮箱有效分钟数，正整数，默认 1440（24 小时）"
msgstr "Optional: mailbox validity in minutes, a positive integer, Default 1440 (24 hours)"

msgid "选填：非负整数时间戳（秒）；不传返回当前全部邮件，传入后仅返回该时间之后的新邮件"
msgstr "Optional: non-negative integer timestamp (seconds); if omitted all current mail is returned, otherwise only mail newer than that time"

msgid "邮件 ID"
msgstr "Mail ID"

msgid "邮件不存在（或已过期，保留约 1 小时）返回 20030。"
msgstr "Returns 20030 when the mail does not exist (or has expired, since mail is kept for about 1 hour)."

msgid "邮件发送与虚拟邮箱收发能力。当前接入 2 条线路，后续可继续扩展更多平台/线路。"
msgstr "Email sending plus virtual mailbox send/receive capabilities. 2 channels are currently integrated; more platforms/channels can be added later."

msgid "邮件发送与虚拟邮箱收发能力。当前接入 3 条线路，后续可继续扩展更多平台/线路。"
msgstr "Mail sending plus virtual mailbox send/receive. 3 channels are currently available, with more platforms/channels to come."

msgid "邮件标题"
msgstr "Email subject"

msgid "邮件标题（必填）"
msgstr "Email subject (Required)"

msgid "邮件正文"
msgstr "Email body"

msgid "邮件正文内容"
msgstr "Email body content"

msgid "邮件正文内容（必填）"
msgstr "Email body content (Required)"

msgid "邮箱 v1"
msgstr "Email v1"

msgid "邮箱地址"
msgstr "Mailbox Address"

msgid "邮箱服务把「发信」和「收信」拆成三条线路：邮箱 v1 用平台邮箱发送业务邮件，适合验证码、通知、告警等场景；VMEmail 与 VMEmail(mail.cx) 提供临时邮箱（虚拟邮箱）能力，可随机生成一个邮箱地址并接收来信，常用于注册验证、接口联调、自动化测试等需要一次性邮箱的场合。"
msgstr "The email service splits sending and receiving into three channels: Email v1 sends transactional mail with the platform mailbox, suited to verification codes, notifications and alerts; VMEmail and VMEmail(mail.cx) provide temporary (disposable) mailboxes that generate a random address and receive incoming mail, which is handy for registration checks, API integration and automated tests that need a one-off address."

# ==================== API 文档内容 · 音乐服务 ====================
