msgid "去重规则：更新后若与他条「同名且同歌手」会返回 20031（排除自身）；只改名称或只改歌手到不冲突的组合均可正常更新。"
msgstr "Deduplication rule: if after the update it matches another record with the same name and singer it returns 20031 (excluding itself); changing only the name or only the singer to a non-conflicting combination updates normally."

