msgid "接入方可自定义验证码长度、有效时长、重复发送策略与频控间隔（默认 60 秒），用于防止短信被刷；核验在阿里云侧完成，调用方无需自己存储和比对验证码。"
msgstr "Integrators can configure the code length, validity period, duplicate-send policy and throttling interval (60 seconds by default) to prevent SMS abuse. Verification happens on Alibaba Cloud's side, so you do not need to store or compare codes yourself."

