msgid "文件字段与 URL/base64 字段至少提供一个；同时提供时文件优先。"
msgstr "Provide at least one of the file field or the URL/base64 field; when both are provided, the file takes precedence."

msgid "本服务需项目签名。识别准确率受图片质量与干扰强度影响，建议对失败结果做重试或人工兜底。"
msgstr "This service requires project signature authentication. Accuracy depends on image quality and noise level, so plan for retries or a manual fallback on failures."

msgid "本服务需项目签名；上传文件时请求体为 multipart/form-data。"
msgstr "This Service requires a project signature; when uploading a file, the request body is multipart/form-data."

msgid "检测图片中的目标位置，返回各目标的边界框与置信度。"
msgstr "Detect target positions in an image and return the bounding box and confidence of each target."

msgid "注意：后端每次调用都会新建识别实例，此接口只对“该次调用”的实例生效，不会改变之后 /ocr 请求的字符集。"
msgstr "Note: the backend creates a new recognition instance on every call; this Endpoint only applies to the instance of \"that call\" and does not change the character set of subsequent /ocr requests."

msgid "滑块匹配（差异比较法）"
msgstr "Slider Matching (Difference Comparison Method)"

msgid "滑块匹配（边缘匹配法）"
msgstr "Slider Matching (Edge Matching Method)"

msgid "滑块图片(上传)"
msgstr "Slider Image (Upload)"

msgid "滑块（slide_image / slide_image_url）与背景（bg_image / bg_image_url）各至少提供其一；同时提供时文件优先。"
msgstr "Provide at least one from each of the slider (slide_image / slide_image_url) and background (bg_image / bg_image_url); when both are provided, the file takes precedence."

msgid "目标检测"
msgstr "Object Detection"

msgid "直接比较滑块图与背景图差异定位缺口（算法二）。"
msgstr "Locate the gap by directly comparing the difference between the slider image and the background image (algorithm 2)."

msgid "简单目标模式"
msgstr "Simple Target Mode"

msgid "纯本地模型识别，无第三方依赖回调。首次调用会加载模型、响应偏慢属正常。"
msgstr "Pure local model recognition with no third-party dependency callbacks. The first call loads the model, so a slower response is normal."

msgid "背景图片(上传)"
msgstr "Background Image (Upload)"

msgid "自定义颜色范围(JSON 对象)"
msgstr "Custom Color Ranges (JSON Object)"

msgid "设置 OCR 字符范围"
msgstr "Set OCR Character Range"

msgid "设置本次识别实例的字符范围（预定义编号或自定义字符集）。"
msgstr "Set the character range of this recognition instance (a predefined number or a custom character set)."

msgid "识别图片中的文字内容，返回识别文本；可返回概率、按颜色过滤等。"
msgstr "Recognize the text content in an image and return the recognized text; it can also return probability and filter by color."

msgid "识别实例的字符范围可配置（预定义编号或自定义字符集），在识别特定站点的验证码前先设置字符集，通常能明显提升准确率。"
msgstr "The character set of a recognition instance is configurable, either through a predefined index or a custom character set; setting it before recognizing a particular site's CAPTCHA usually improves accuracy noticeably."

msgid "返回概率分布"
msgstr "Return Probability Distribution"

msgid "选填：HSV 区间字典，需与 colors 配合使用"
msgstr "Optional: an HSV range dictionary, used together with colors"

msgid "选填：仅识别指定颜色文字，如 [\"red\",\"blue\",\"green\"]"
msgstr "Optional: recognize only text of the specified colors, e.g. [\"red\",\"blue\",\"green\"]"

msgid "选填：配合 Beta 模型使用"
msgstr "Optional: used together with the Beta model"

msgid "选填：默认 false"
msgstr "Optional: Default false"

msgid "通过边缘检测匹配滑块小图在背景大图中的缺口位置（算法一）。"
msgstr "Match the gap position of the slider thumbnail within the background image via edge detection (algorithm 1)."

msgid "颜色过滤(JSON 数组)"
msgstr "Color Filter (JSON Array)"

msgid "验证码识别API,ddddocr,OCR识别接口,滑块验证码识别"

msgid "验证码识别服务基于 ddddocr 提供通用 OCR 能力：识别图片中的文字、检测图片内的目标位置，以及匹配滑块验证码的缺口位置（提供两种算法），常用于自动化测试与验证码相关的兼容性处理。"
msgstr "The CAPTCHA recognition service provides general OCR based on ddddocr: recognizing text in an image, detecting target positions within an image, and locating the gap in slider CAPTCHAs (two algorithms are available). It is commonly used for automated testing and CAPTCHA compatibility work."
msgstr "CAPTCHA Recognition API,ddddocr,OCR API,Slider CAPTCHA Recognition"


# ==================== API 文档内容 · 文件上传 ====================
msgid "multipart/form-data 文件字段 file：直接用下方“选择文件”上传即可。"
msgstr "multipart/form-data file field file: just use the \"Select File\" button below to upload."

