msgid "PicUI 图床"
msgstr "PicUI Image Host"

msgid "PicUI 账号 Token 由服务端 Token 池自动选取，调用方无需（也无法）指定；上传成功后按 PicUI 返回的图片大小扣减该 Token 容量，容量用尽自动删除并切换下一个。"
msgstr "The PicUI account Token is selected automatically from the server-side Token pool, so the caller neither needs nor is able to specify it; after a successful upload the Token capacity is decremented by the image size returned by PicUI, and once the capacity is exhausted the Token is deleted automatically and the next one is used."

msgid "PicUI（v2.picui.cn）图片托管"
msgstr "PicUI (v2.picui.cn) image hosting"

msgid "Token"
msgstr "Token"

msgid "Token 唯一：同一个 Token 只会入库一条，重复导入不会重复写入（库中已存在、或同一批请求里重复出现的，都计入 duplicated 跳过）。"
msgstr "Tokens are unique: the same Token is stored only once, so repeated imports create no duplicates (those already in the database, or repeated within the same request, are counted in duplicated and skipped)."

msgid "Token 文件"
msgstr "Token File"

msgid "Token 池为空或容量均已用尽时返回 50002，请先调用「导入 Token」接口补充。"
msgstr "Returns 50002 when the Token pool is empty or all capacities are exhausted; call the Import Tokens endpoint first."

msgid "auto（默认，静态图转 webp）"
msgstr "auto (default, static images are converted to webp)"

msgid "count：当前池内可用的 Token 数量"
