msgstr "r2 (Cloudflare R2)"

msgid "scdn 线路支持上传本地图片或传入远程图片 URL，服务端按内容 SHA-256 秒传——同一张图片重复上传会直接返回已有链接，不会额外占用容量；picui 线路附带服务端 Token 池管理，可查看各 Token 的已用与剩余容量，并支持批量补充 Token。"
msgstr "The scdn channel accepts a local image or a remote image URL, and the server de-duplicates by SHA-256 content hash, so uploading the same image again returns the existing link without consuming extra capacity. The picui channel adds server-side Token-pool management: view used and remaining capacity per Token, and top up Tokens in bulk."

msgid "scdn.io 图床"
msgstr "scdn.io Image Host"

msgid "scdn.io（img.scdn.io）图片托管"
msgstr "scdn.io (img.scdn.io) image hosting"

msgid "telegram"
msgstr "telegram"

msgid "token_file 为按行存放 Token 的文本文件（一行一个），可与 tokens 同时使用。"
msgstr "token_file is a text file with one Token per line; it can be used together with tokens."

msgid "tokens 支持重复字段、逗号或换行分隔，一次可提交多个 Token；Token 内不能含空格等空白字符（文件里若带注释/多余列会被拒绝，避免导入无效 Token）。"
msgstr "tokens supports repeated fields and comma- or newline-separated values, so several Tokens can be submitted at once; Tokens must not contain whitespace such as spaces (files with comments or extra columns are rejected to avoid importing invalid Tokens)."

msgid "total_capacity_bytes / total_used_bytes / total_remaining_bytes：与上面三项一一对应的字节值，便于程序精确计算"
msgstr "total_capacity_bytes / total_used_bytes / total_remaining_bytes: byte values corresponding one-to-one to the three fields above, for precise computation in code"

msgid "total_capacity_mb：全部 Token 的总容量合计（MB）"
msgstr "total_capacity_mb: total capacity of all Tokens (MB)"

msgid "total_remaining_mb：全部 Token 的剩余容量合计（MB）—— 即系统当前还能上传的总容量，看这个字段判断是否要补货"
msgstr "total_remaining_mb: total remaining capacity of all Tokens (MB) — how much you can still upload; use this field to decide whether to restock"

msgid "total_used_mb：全部 Token 的已用容量合计（MB）"
msgstr "total_used_mb: total used capacity of all Tokens (MB)"

msgid "true（加密上传）"
msgstr "true (encrypted upload)"

msgid "webp"
msgstr "webp"

msgid "webp_animated（动图）"
msgstr "webp_animated (animated)"

msgid "上传一张图片，返回可直接引用的 CDN 外链。"
msgstr "Upload an image and get a directly usable CDN link."

msgid "上传一张图片，返回可直接引用的外链地址（含 html / markdown 等多种引用格式）。"
msgstr "Upload an image and get a directly usable link (with html / markdown and other reference formats)."

msgid "上传图片返回外链；PicUI 账号 Token 由服务端 Token 池统一持有并记账，容量用尽自动切换，调用方无需提供账号。需项目签名调用。"
msgstr "Uploads an image and returns a link; the PicUI account Token is held and accounted for by the server-side Token pool, switching automatically when capacity runs out, so the caller needs no account. Requires a project signature."

msgid "上传图片返回外链；服务端按 SHA-256 秒传，重复图片直接返回已有链接。需项目签名调用。"
msgstr "Uploads an image and returns a link; the server deduplicates by SHA-256 and returns the existing link for duplicate images. Requires a project signature."

msgid "不传（PicUI 默认公开）"
msgstr "Not provided (PicUI default: public)"

msgid "不传（默认 local）"
msgstr "Not provided (default local)"

msgid "两条线路均需项目签名。第三方图床的链接可用性由对方平台决定，重要图片建议自行留存原图。"
msgstr "Both channels require project signature authentication. Link availability on third-party hosts is up to them, so keep the original files for anything important."

msgid "临时上传Token"
msgstr "Temporary Upload Token"

msgid "令牌池告警：上传后若池内剩余容量跌破 50MB，系统会自动向管理员邮箱（环境变量 QQ_MAIL_ACCOUNT，未配置则不发送）发送一封补货提醒邮件；该告警只在「跌破」的那一次发送，补货回到 50MB 以上后再次跌破才会重新告警。"
msgstr "Pool alert: after an upload, if the remaining pool capacity drops below 50MB the system automatically sends one restock reminder to the admin mailbox (environment variable QQ_MAIL_ACCOUNT; nothing is sent if it is not configured). The alert is sent only on the crossing itself, and fires again only after the pool is restocked above 50MB and drops below again."

msgid "储存策略ID"
msgstr "Storage Strategy ID"

msgid "单个容量(MB)"
msgstr "Capacity per Token (MB)"

msgid "单位说明：容量同时提供 MB（保留 2 位小数，便于阅读）与字节（便于计算）两种单位。"
msgstr "Units: capacity is provided both in MB (2 decimal places, easy to read) and in bytes (easy to compute)."

msgid "单次最多导入 1000 个 Token；本服务需项目签名（app_id/timestamp/nonce/sign）。"
msgstr "Up to 1000 Tokens per import; this service requires a project signature (app_id/timestamp/nonce/sign)."

msgid "可重复传参，或用逗号、换行分隔一次提交多个"
msgstr "Repeatable; or separate several values with commas or newlines to submit them at once"

msgid "向 Token 池新增一个或多个 Token（支持直接输入，也支持上传按行存放的 Token 文件）。"
msgstr "Add one or more Tokens to the pool (enter them directly, or upload a file with one Token per line)."

msgid "启用密码"
msgstr "Enable Password"

msgid "图床API,免费图床,图片外链,图片CDN"
msgstr "Image Hosting API,Free Image Hosting,Image Direct Link,Image CDN"

msgid "图床服务"
msgstr "Image Hosting"

msgid "图床服务把图片上传到第三方托管平台并返回可直接引用的 CDN 外链，适合做站点配图、Markdown 图床、用户头像托管等场景，省去自建存储与带宽。"
msgstr "The image hosting service uploads images to third-party hosting platforms and returns CDN direct links, ideal for site illustrations, Markdown image hosting and user avatars, with no need to run your own storage or bandwidth."

msgid "图片外链托管：上传图片（或 ≤10 秒短视频）返回可直链访问的 CDN 地址，支持输出格式、加密与存储位置选择。当前接入 2 条线路。"
msgstr "Image hosting: upload an image (or a video up to 10 seconds) and get a directly linkable CDN address, with options for output format, encryption and storage location. 2 channels are currently available."

msgid "图片权限"
msgstr "Image Permission"

msgid "存储位置"
msgstr "Storage Location"

msgid "容量用尽（已用 ≥ 容量）的 Token 会被自动删除，因此 items 中出现的 Token 均可继续使用；服务器只做容量记账，不参与图片存储。"
msgstr "Tokens whose capacity is exhausted (used ≥ capacity) are deleted automatically, so every Token listed in items can still be used; the server only keeps capacity records and never stores images."

msgid "密码模式"
msgstr "Password Mode"

msgid "导入 Token"
msgstr "Import Tokens"

msgid "服务端按 SHA-256 秒传：命中时 message 为「图片已存在，秒传成功！」，deduped=true。"
msgstr "The server deduplicates by SHA-256: on a hit the message reports that the image already exists and was deduplicated, and deduped=true."

msgid "本地图片文件（multipart 字段 image），必需"
msgstr "Local image file (multipart field image), required"

msgid "本地图片文件（multipart 字段 image，支持 jpg/png/webp/gif/bmp/tiff）；与 image_url 二选一"
msgstr "Local image file (multipart field image; supports jpg/png/webp/gif/bmp/tiff); choose either this or image_url"

msgid "本服务需项目签名（app_id/timestamp/nonce/sign）；在线调试由服务端自动代签。"
msgstr "This service requires a project signature (app_id/timestamp/nonce/sign); the online debugger signs automatically on the server side."

msgid "查看 Token 池整体容量与每个 Token 的已用 / 剩余容量（Token 已脱敏）。"
msgstr "View the overall pool capacity plus the used / remaining capacity of each Token (Tokens are masked)."

msgid "查询 Token 池"
msgstr "Query Token Pool"

msgid "留空由服务端自动选择"
msgstr "Leave empty to let the server choose"

msgid "相册ID"
msgstr "Album ID"

msgid "访问密码"
msgstr "Access Password"

msgid "请求体为 multipart/form-data（文件字段 image，可直接用下方“选择文件”上传）。"
msgstr "The request body is multipart/form-data (file field image; use the file picker below to upload directly)."

msgid "请求体为 multipart/form-data（文件字段 image，可直接用下方“选择文件”上传）；用 image_url 时也可用 application/x-www-form-urlencoded。"
msgstr "The request body is multipart/form-data (file field image; use the file picker below to upload directly); when using image_url you may also use application/x-www-form-urlencoded."

msgid "输出格式"
msgstr "Output Format"

msgid "过期时间"
msgstr "Expiry Time"

msgid "返回 data 含 url / filename / storage_backend / 压缩统计 / deduped（是否秒传） / password_protected。"
msgstr "data contains url / filename / storage_backend / compression stats / deduped (whether the image was deduplicated) / password_protected."

msgid "返回 data 含 url / size_kb / size_bytes / mimetype / extension / md5 / sha1 / links（html、bbcode、markdown、markdown_with_link、thumbnail_url 等）。"
msgstr "data contains url / size_kb / size_bytes / mimetype / extension / md5 / sha1 / links (html, bbcode, markdown, markdown_with_link, thumbnail_url, etc.)."

msgid "返回 data 字段：submitted 本次提交的 Token 数（已按行/逗号拆分并去重）；created 实际新增数量；duplicated 因已存在而跳过的数量；duplicated_tokens 被跳过的 Token 脱敏列表；capacity_bytes / capacity_mb 每个新 Token 的容量。"
msgstr "data fields: submitted = number of Tokens submitted (after splitting by line/comma and deduplicating); created = number actually added; duplicated = number skipped as already existing; duplicated_tokens = masked list of skipped Tokens; capacity_bytes / capacity_mb = capacity of each new Token."

msgid "返回 data 顶层字段："
msgstr "data top-level fields:"

msgid "远程图片 URL"
msgstr "Remote Image URL"

msgid "远程图片地址（http/https），服务端代理拉取；与 image 二选一"
msgstr "Remote image address (http/https), fetched by the server; choose either this or image"

msgid "选填：PicUI 临时上传 Token（对应其 token 字段），一般不传"
msgstr "Optional: PicUI temporary upload Token (its token field); usually not passed"

msgid "选填：PicUI 储存策略 ID，默认 1（「普通用户」策略）"
msgstr "Optional: PicUI storage strategy ID, default 1 (the regular user strategy)"

msgid "选填：password_enabled=true 时必填"
msgstr "Optional: required when password_enabled=true"

msgid "选填：password_type=qa 时必填"
msgstr "Optional: required when password_type=qa"

msgid "选填：加密上传（加密图永不参与秒传）"
msgstr "Optional: encrypted upload (encrypted images never take part in deduplication)"

msgid "选填：图片权限，留空使用 PicUI 默认值"
msgstr "Optional: image permission; leave empty to use the PicUI default"

msgid "选填：图片过期时间，格式 yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss"
msgstr "Optional: image expiry time, format yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss"

msgid "选填：存储位置"
msgstr "Optional: storage location"

msgid "选填：密码模式，默认 plain"
msgstr "Optional: password mode, default plain"

msgid "选填：待新增的 Token，可多个（与 token_file 至少传一项）"
msgstr "Optional: Tokens to add, several allowed (provide at least one of this and token_file)"

msgid "选填：指定外链 CDN 域名（如 img.scdn.io），留空自动选择"
msgstr "Optional: specify the CDN domain for the links (e.g. img.scdn.io); leave empty to choose automatically"

msgid "选填：文本文件，按行存放 Token（一行一个，UTF-8）"
msgstr "Optional: text file with one Token per line (UTF-8)"

msgid "选填：每个 Token 的容量（MB），默认 50"
msgstr "Optional: capacity of each Token (MB), default 50"

msgid "选填：目标相册 ID"
msgstr "Optional: target album ID"

msgid "选填：输出格式，默认 auto"
msgstr "Optional: output format, default auto"

msgid "问题文本"
msgstr "Issue Text"

msgid "默认 1"
msgstr "Default 1"


# ==================== API 文档内容 · 爬虫验证 ====================
msgid "4759 蜘蛛 IP 验证"
msgstr "4759 Spider IP Verification"

msgid "4759 蜘蛛/爬虫 IP 库"
msgstr "4759 spider/crawler IP library"

msgid "GET 查询接口；本服务需项目签名。"
msgstr "GET query Endpoint; this Service requires a project signature."

msgid "只读查询接口，支持 IPv4 与 IPv6。查询需访问外部 IP 库，单次耗时可能偏长，属正常现象。"
msgstr "It is a read-only query API supporting both IPv4 and IPv6. Queries reach an external IP database, so a single call may take a while, which is normal."

msgid "只读查询接口：提交一个 IP，服务端查证其是否为搜索引擎（如百度/谷歌等）爬虫来源。"
msgstr "Read-only query Endpoint: submit an IP and the server checks whether it originates from a search engine crawler (such as Baidu/Google, etc.)."

msgid "如 66.249.65.205（Google 爬虫）"
msgstr "e.g. 66.249.65.205 (Google crawler)"

msgid "对外部服务查询耗时可能较长，属正常；接口返回 data 为爬虫验证结果（含是否为爬虫及来源类型，以实际返回为准）。"
msgstr "Querying the external service may take a while, which is normal; the Endpoint returns data as the Spider verification result (including whether it is a crawler and the source type, subject to the actual response)."

msgid "待验证 IP"
msgstr "IP to verify"

msgid "必填：合法的 IPv4 或 IPv6 地址"
msgstr "Required: a valid IPv4 or IPv6 address"

msgid "本服务需项目签名。识别结果依赖第三方 IP 库的覆盖范围，建议作为参考而非唯一判定条件。"
msgstr "This service requires project signature authentication. Results depend on the coverage of the third-party IP database, so treat them as a reference rather than the sole criterion."

msgid "爬虫验证API,环境检测接口,自动化检测"
msgstr "Spider Verification API,Environment Detection API,Automation Detection"

msgid "爬虫验证服务用于判断一个 IP 是否来自搜索引擎爬虫：提交 IP，服务端查询蜘蛛 IP 库并返回识别结论与来源类型，可用于访问日志分析、来源统计，或做「真爬虫才给收录内容」这类判断的辅助依据。"
msgstr "The spider verification service determines whether an IP comes from a search-engine crawler: submit an IP and the server queries a spider IP database, returning the verdict and the source type. It can support access-log analysis and referrer statistics, or decisions such as only serving indexable content to genuine crawlers."

msgid "识别自动化/爬虫环境：验证指定 IP 是否属于搜索引擎爬虫。当前接入 4759 验证线路。"
msgstr "Identify Automated environments/crawlers: verify whether a given IP belongs to a search engine crawler. Currently connected to the 4759 verification Channel."

msgid "验证 IP 是否爬虫"
msgstr "Verify Whether an IP Is a Crawler"

msgid "验证给定 IP 是否为搜索引擎爬虫，返回识别结论与类型信息。"
msgstr "Verify whether a given IP is a search engine crawler and return the recognition conclusion and type information."

