msgstr "e.g. Beijing,Shanghai"

msgid "如 电信"
msgstr "e.g. China Telecom"

msgid "巨量代理 IP"
msgstr "Juliang Proxy IP"

msgid "按 ip:port 从 JSON 文件删除一条静态代理。"
msgstr "Delete a static proxy from the JSON file by ip:port."

msgid "按次提取国内动态代理 IP。官方签名与参数集严格绑定（改任何参数都会验签失败），故提供两种凭据模式（二选一）：key 模式 = 传业务密钥，由服务端按官方规则代算签名，可自由传 num / area / isp 等任意参数；custom_sign 模式 = 传自己算好的签名，参数原样透传、服务端不补任何默认值。业务编号 / 密钥 / 代理账密默认由平台 .env 持有，调用方也可传自己的（使用自己购买的订单）。注：官方文档里的签名参数叫 sign，本接口对外叫 custom_sign——平台自身的鉴权参数已占用 sign，服务端会把 custom_sign 原样传给官方接口的 sign 字段。"
msgstr "Extracts domestic dynamic proxy IPs on demand. Because the official signature is strictly bound to the parameter set (changing any parameter fails verification), two credential modes are offered (choose one): key mode = pass your business key and the server computes the signature per the official rules, so num / area / isp and any other parameter can be passed freely; custom_sign mode = pass your own precomputed signature and parameters are forwarded as-is with no server-side defaults. The business ID / key / proxy credentials are held by the platform .env by default, and the caller may also pass their own (using their own purchased order). Note: in the official docs the signature parameter is called sign, while this API exposes it as custom_sign — the platform auth parameter already uses sign, and the server passes custom_sign through to the official sign field."

msgid "提取巨量代理动态 IP，返回解析好的 ip:port 列表（默认 JSON 格式）。"
msgstr "Extract Juliang dynamic proxy IPs and return a parsed ip:port list (JSON format by default)."

msgid "支持白名单或账号密码两种认证方式，二选一即可；修改授权后约 5 分钟生效。"
msgstr "Supports either Whitelist or username/password authentication; choose one. Changes to authorization take effect in about 5 minutes."

msgid "数量"
msgstr "Count"

msgid "文本分隔符"
msgstr "Text Separator"

msgid "新增静态代理"
msgstr "Add Static Proxy"

msgid "未传 username/password 而使用平台默认账号时，响应会把该账号回显给调用方。"
msgstr "When username/password are omitted and the platform default account is used, the response echoes that account back to the caller."

msgid "白名单认证：不传 username/password，需先在 91HTTP 后台加白本机公网 IP。"
msgstr "Whitelist authentication: do not provide username/password; you must first whitelist your machine's public IP in the 91HTTP console."

msgid "端口"
msgstr "Port"

msgid "网关主机"
msgstr "Gateway Host"

msgid "网关型代理：入口主机 / 端口固定，出口 IP 由 Thordata 侧轮换，故返回的是可直接使用的入口地址，而非 IP 列表。主机 / 端口 / 账号 / 密码可由调用方传入，不传则用平台 .env 配置；verify=true 会真实经代理发一次请求（消耗住宅流量）。"
msgstr "Gateway-type proxy: the entry host/port are fixed while the egress IP is rotated by Thordata, so this returns a ready-to-use entry address instead of an IP list. The host/port/username/password can be provided by the caller; if omitted, the platform .env configuration is used. verify=true sends one real request through the proxy (consumes residential traffic)."

msgid "网关端口"
msgstr "Gateway Port"

msgid "自动加白名单"
msgstr "Auto-add to Whitelist"

msgid "自动白名单"
msgstr "Auto Whitelist"

msgid "自算签名"
msgstr "Self-computed Signature"

msgid "节点到期后连接会失败，需重新提取并在 .env 更新，或由调用方传入新节点信息。"
msgstr "After the node expires the connection fails; re-extract and update the .env value, or pass the new node info from the caller side."

msgid "获取 91HTTP 动态代理，可指定协议/白名单/过期时间等。"
msgstr "Get a 91HTTP dynamic proxy; you can specify protocol/whitelist/Expiry time, etc."

msgid "获取代理并可选验证连通性；verify=true 时按速度排序返回最快的代理。"
msgstr "Get proxies with optional connectivity verification; when verify=true, returns the fastest proxies sorted by speed."

