msgstr "Required: feedback ID (the feedback_id returned by create)"

msgid "必填：被查看的评论 ID"
msgstr "Required: ID of the comment being viewed"

msgid "提交反馈"
msgstr "Submit feedback"

msgid "数据按接入项目隔离——每个项目只能看到自己的反馈与评论；提交反馈与评论时会额外校验用户的登录 Token，因此反馈人身份真实可信，子项目无法伪造。"
msgstr "Data is isolated per integrated project, so each project only sees its own feedback and comments. Submitting feedback and comments additionally validates the user's log-in Token, so the reporter's identity is trustworthy and cannot be forged by a sub-project."

msgid "新建一条反馈（title/content 必填），反馈人身份由 token 校验。"
msgstr "Create a feedback (title/content required); the reporter's identity is verified by token."

msgid "某条评论的全部子孙回复（扁平、分页、不分层级），防海量评论撑爆响应。"
msgstr "All descendant replies of a comment (flat, paginated, no hierarchy), preventing huge comment threads from bloating the response."

msgid "标题"
msgstr "Title"

msgid "状态"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "用户 Token"
msgstr "User Token"

msgid "用户中心登录后获取"
