msgid "email / phone 至少提供一个；两步注册时 data.need_verify=true，需再调 verify/email 或 verify/phone 校验通过后才创建账号。"
msgstr "Provide at least one of email / phone; for two-step sign-up data.need_verify=true, and the account is created only after verify/email or verify/phone passes."

msgid "不带 code 时必填：account/email/phone 任一标识 + 密码"
msgstr "Required when code is omitted: one of account/email/phone plus a password"

msgid "仅支持已绑定邮箱/手机号的账号；纯用户名账号没有可验证通道，无法自助重置。"
msgstr "Only accounts with a bound email/phone are supported; username-only accounts have no verification channel and cannot reset the password themselves."

msgid "仅需项目签名参数，无需业务参数。"
msgstr "Only the project signature parameters are required; no business parameters."

msgid "供子项目确认用户身份：校验 token 有效性。"
msgstr "Lets sub-projects confirm a user's identity by verifying the token's validity."

msgid "删除当前项目下该 Token。"
msgstr "Delete this Token under the current project."

msgid "发送两步注册的手机短信验证码（60 秒冷却）。"
msgstr "Send the SMS verification code for two-step sign-up (60-second cooldown)."

msgid "发送注册短信"
msgstr "Send Sign-up SMS"

msgid "发送登录验证码"
msgstr "Send Login Verification Code"

msgid "发送重置密码验证码"
msgstr "Send Password Reset Code"

msgid "只提供 username（即\"用户名+密码注册\"）已停用，返回 30001 业务规则限制。"
msgstr "Providing username only (i.e. username + password sign-up) is disabled and returns 30001 (business rule restriction)."

msgid "可用注册/登录方式"
msgstr "Available Sign-up / Login Methods"

msgid "同一项目+凭证+IP 连续失败 5 次锁定 15 分钟（返回 20040）。"
msgstr "5 consecutive failures for the same project + credential + IP locks it for 15 minutes (returns 20040)."

msgid "带 code 即走邮箱/手机号验证码登录（免密码）"
msgstr "With code, it uses email/phone verification-code login (no password needed)"

msgid "必填：用户在该项目下持有的登录 Token（login 成功返回）"
msgstr "Required: the login Token the user holds under this project (returned by a successful login)"

msgid "密码登录的标识三选一：account / email / phone（邮箱与手机号需已注册）。"
msgstr "Password login accepts any one of three identifiers: account / email / phone (email and phone must be registered)."

msgid "忘记密码第一步：校验邮箱/手机号已注册后发码（60 秒冷却）。"
msgstr "Forgot-password step 1: verify that the email/phone is registered, then send the code (60-second cooldown)."

msgid "忘记密码第二步：校验验证码通过后设置新密码。"
msgstr "Forgot-password step 2: after the code is verified, set the new password."

msgid "成功返回 data={valid, user_id, account, username}。"
msgstr "Returns data={valid, user_id, account, username} on success."

msgid "手机号+密码登录，或手机号+code 验证码登录"
msgstr "Phone + password login, or phone + code verification login"

msgid "手机号两步验证"
msgstr "Phone Two-Step Verification"

msgid "手机验证码校验，通过后创建账号并发放。"
msgstr "Verifies the phone code and, once passed, creates and issues the account."

msgid "按 token 查询用户信息。"
msgstr "Look up user information by token."

msgid "接入项目信息"
msgstr "Integration Project Info"

msgid "提供 email → 两步注册第一步，需再验证邮箱"
msgstr "Provide email → first step of two-step sign-up; the email must then be verified"

msgid "提供 phone → 两步注册第一步，需再验证手机号"
msgstr "Provide phone → first step of two-step sign-up; the phone number must then be verified"

msgid "查询调用方（签名所属项目）自身信息，用于核对配置。"
msgstr "Query the caller's own info (the project the signature belongs to) to check the configuration."

msgid "注册（只支持邮箱 / 手机号）：提交邮箱或手机号 + 密码走两步注册，先发验证码。"
msgstr "Sign up (email / phone only): submit an email or phone number plus a password to start two-step sign-up, which sends the code first."

msgid "浏览器打开邮件内激活链接，校验通过后创建账号并发放。"
msgstr "Open the activation link in the email in a browser; once verified, the account is created and issued."

msgid "激活令牌"
msgstr "Activation token"

msgid "用户中心API,统一认证,注册登录接口,Token验证"
msgstr "User Center API,Unified Authentication,Sign-up and Log-in API,Token Verification"

msgid "用户中心是一套统一账号系统（UAC）：所有接入项目共用一个全局用户池，用户在一个项目下注册的账号，在其它项目下同样可以登录，不必每个项目各建一套账号体系。"
msgstr "The user center is a unified account system (UAC): all integrated projects share one global user pool, so an account registered under one project can also log in under others, with no need to build a separate account system per project."

msgid "用户账号体系"
msgstr "User Account System"

msgid "登录态用 Token 承载，Token 绑定签发它的接入项目。注册仅支持邮箱或手机号，且为两步流程——先提交凭证发验证码，校验通过后才真正创建账号，可有效防止恶意批量注册；忘记密码同样走「先发码、再校验改密」，重置成功后会作废该用户的全部 Token。"
msgstr "Sessions are carried by Tokens, and each Token is bound to the project that issued it. Sign-up supports email or mobile number only and is a two-step flow: submit the credential to receive a code, and the account is created only after the code is verified, which effectively prevents bulk malicious registrations. Password recovery follows the same pattern, sending a code first and verifying before the password is changed, and a successful reset invalidates all of that user's Tokens."

msgid "登录：账号/邮箱/手机号+密码；或邮箱/手机号+验证码。成功返回绑定项目的 Token。"
msgstr "Log in: account/email/phone + password, or email/phone + verification code. On success, returns a Token bound to the project."

msgid "统一账号中心（UAC）：全局用户池，多方式注册/登录、Token 签发与验证、两步注册邮箱/手机号校验。"
msgstr "Unified Account Center (UAC): a global user pool with multi-method sign-up/log-in, Token issuance and verification, and email/phone verification for two-step sign-up."

msgid "统一账号池（Token 绑定接入项目）"
msgstr "Unified Account Pool (Token bound to the integration project)"

msgid "账号"
msgstr "Account"

msgid "账号+密码登录：系统发放的账号"
msgstr "Account + password login: the account issued by the system"

msgid "返回 HTML 结果页；在线调试会得到 HTML 原文，属正常。"
msgstr "Returns an HTML result page; live debug will show the raw HTML, which is expected."

msgid "返回 data={methods:[email,phone], username:false}；客户端先查此接口再渲染表单，username=false 表示\"用户名+密码注册\"已停用。"
msgstr "Returns data={methods:[email,phone], username:false}; clients should call this endpoint first before rendering the form — username=false means username + password sign-up is disabled."

msgid "返回后台启用的注册/登录方式（公开，免签名）。"
msgstr "Returns the sign-up/log-in methods enabled in the backend (public, no signature required)."

msgid "返回当前接入项目配置（含 Token 默认有效期等）。"
msgstr "Returns the current integration project's configuration (including the Token's default validity period, etc.)."

msgid "选填：仅用于展示，不作为注册凭证"
msgstr "Optional: for display only, not a sign-up credential"

msgid "邮件内链接专用（浏览器访问）"
msgstr "For in-email links only (opened in a browser)"

msgid "邮箱+密码登录，或邮箱+code 验证码登录"
msgstr "Email + password login, or email + code verification login"

msgid "邮箱/手机号验证码登录第一步：校验已注册后发码（60 秒冷却）。"
msgstr "First step of email/phone verification-code login: verifies the account is registered, then sends the code (60-second cooldown)."

msgid "邮箱两步验证(验证码)"
msgstr "Email Two-Step Verification (Code)"

msgid "邮箱激活链接"
msgstr "Email Activation Link"

msgid "邮箱激活链接（公开 GET）"
msgstr "Email Activation Link (Public GET)"

msgid "邮箱激活链接：用户在邮件里点击的链接，GET 免签名，返回友好 HTML 结果页（非 JSON）。"
msgstr "Email activation link: the link users click in the email; the GET request needs no signature and returns a friendly HTML result page (not JSON)."

msgid "邮箱验证码校验，通过后创建账号并发放。"
msgstr "Verifies the email code and, once passed, creates and issues the account."

msgid "重发两步注册验证邮件（60 秒冷却）。"
msgstr "Resend the two-step sign-up verification email (60-second cooldown)."

msgid "重发验证邮件"
msgstr "Resend Verification Email"

msgid "重置成功会作废该用户全部已签发 Token（所有已登录设备需重新登录）。"
msgstr "A successful reset invalidates all Tokens issued to that user (every signed-in device must log in again)."

msgid "链接中的 token（系统生成），正常由用户点邮件链接触发"
msgstr "The token in the link (system-generated), normally triggered when the user clicks the email link"

msgid "除 methods 与邮箱激活链接(GET) 外均需项目签名。邮箱/手机号两步注册流程：先 register（仅暂存+发验证码），再调 verify/email 或 verify/phone 校验通过后才创建账号。"
msgstr "All endpoints require the project signature except methods and the email activation link (GET). Email/phone two-step sign-up flow: call register first (which only stages the data and sends the code), then call verify/email or verify/phone; the account is created only after verification passes."

msgid "除 methods 与邮箱激活链接(GET) 外均需项目签名。邮箱/手机号两步注册流程：先 register（仅暂存+发验证码），再调 verify/email 或 verify/phone 校验通过后才创建账号。忘记密码流程：先调 password/send 发码，再调 password/reset 校验通过后改密（并作废该用户全部 Token）。"
msgstr "Everything except methods and the email activation link (GET) requires a project signature. Two-step email/phone registration: call register first (it only stores the intent and sends a code), then call verify/email or verify/phone to create the account. Forgot password: call password/send for a code, then password/reset to set a new password (which also invalidates all of that user's Tokens)."

msgid "除「可用注册/登录方式」与邮箱激活链接（公开 GET）外，其余接口均需项目签名。客户端建议先查注册/登录方式接口，再按返回结果渲染表单，不要在前端写死支持方式。"
msgstr "Apart from the available sign-up / log-in methods endpoint and the email activation link (public GET), all endpoints require project signature authentication. Clients should query the methods endpoint first and render the form from the result rather than hard-coding the supported methods."

msgid "项目信息"
msgstr "Project Info"

msgid "项目自身配置查询"
msgstr "Query of the Project's Own Configuration"

msgid "验证 Token"
msgstr "Verify Token"


# ==================== API 文档内容 · 电影服务 ====================
msgid "555电影"
msgstr "555 Movies"

msgid "555电影（5dy4.vip）"
msgstr "555 Movies (5dy4.vip)"

msgid "data.groups 含地区 / 题材 / 语言 / 年份 / 排序五组，value 回传给「列表」接口的同名参数。"
msgstr "data.groups holds five groups — region, genre, language, year and sort order; pass value back to the list endpoint as the same-named parameter."

msgid "sid / nid 越界或源站无有效地址时返回 40001。"
msgstr "Returns 40001 when sid / nid are out of range or the source site has no valid URL."

msgid "一次返回首页全部推荐区块，便于直接渲染站点首页。"
msgstr "Returns all home recommendation blocks in one call, ready to render the site home page."

msgid "关键 ID 有固定的传递顺序：分类接口返回的 id 传给列表接口的 type_id，列表中的 id 传给详情接口的 vod_id，详情中的 sid / nid 再传给播放接口取地址，串起来就是一条完整的播放流程。"
msgstr "Key IDs follow a fixed order: the id returned by the categories API goes to the list API's type_id, an item's id goes to the detail API's vod_id, and the sid / nid from the detail response go to the playback API. Chaining them yields a complete playback flow."

msgid "分类 ID"
msgstr "Category ID"

msgid "分类列表"
msgstr "Category List"

msgid "可选：按地区筛选，如 大陆（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 area 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by region, e.g. 大陆 (values come from the area group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：按年份筛选，如 2026（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 year 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by year, e.g. 2026 (values come from the year group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：按语言筛选，如 国语（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 lang 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by language, e.g. 国语 (values come from the lang group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：按题材筛选，如 动作（取值见「筛选条件」接口的 genre 组）。"
msgstr "Optional: filter by genre, e.g. 动作 (values come from the genre group of the filters endpoint)."

msgid "可选：排序方式 time/hits/score。"
msgstr "Optional: sort order time / hits / score."

msgid "可选：页码，从 1 开始，默认 1。"
msgstr "Optional: page number, starting from 1, default 1."

msgid "各分类的可用值不同（例如动漫有「日本 / 欧美」，综艺有「真人秀 / 脱口秀」），年份还会随站点上新自动增加，建议由本接口动态渲染筛选栏，不要在客户端写死。"
msgstr "Available values differ per category (anime offers Japan / Europe & America, variety offers Reality Show / Talk Show, and so on), and the year list grows as the site adds titles. Render the filter bar from this endpoint instead of hard-coding values in the client."

msgid "地区"
msgstr "Region"

msgid "地区 / 题材 / 语言 / 年份 / 排序可任意组合，源站按交集返回；组合后没有匹配影片时 data.items 为空数组，不会报错。"
msgstr "Region / genre / language / year / sort can be combined freely and the source site returns the intersection. When a combination matches nothing, data.items is an empty array rather than an error."

msgid "实时爬取源站并缓存。数据类（片名/详情/集数）缓存较久，播放地址（m3u8）缓存较短以便及时刷新。"
msgstr "Crawls the source site in real time and caches the results. Data (titles / details / episode counts) is cached longer, while playback URLs (m3u8) are cached briefly so they stay fresh."

msgid "年份"
msgstr "Year"

msgid "影片 ID"
msgstr "Movie ID"

msgid "影片不存在时返回 40001。"
msgstr "Returns 40001 when the movie does not exist."

msgid "影片详情"
msgstr "Movie Details"

msgid "必填：分类 ID（见「分类列表」接口），如 1=电影 2=连续剧。"
msgstr "Required: category ID (see the category list endpoint), e.g. 1=Movies 2=TV Series."

msgid "必填：分类 ID，1=电影 2=连续剧 3=综艺纪录 4=动漫 124=福利 126=擦边短剧（子分类见「分类列表」接口的 sub）。"
msgstr "Required: category ID — 1=Movies 2=TV Series 3=Variety & Documentary 4=Anime 124=Premium 126=Short Dramas (sub-categories come from sub in the category list endpoint)."

msgid "必填：影片 ID（取自列表/搜索结果中的 id）。"
msgstr "Required: movie ID (from the id field in list / search results)."

msgid "必填：搜索关键词（片名）。"
msgstr "Required: search keyword (title)."

msgid "必填：播放源序号，取自详情接口 sources[].sid。"
msgstr "Required: playback source index, from sources[].sid in the detail response."

msgid "必填：集数序号，取自选集 episodes[].nid（电影通常为 1）。"
msgstr "Required: episode index, from episodes[].nid (usually 1 for movies)."

msgid "按人气"
msgstr "By Popularity"

msgid "按关键词搜索影片。"
msgstr "Search movies by keyword."

msgid "按分类获取影片列表，支持分页、排序与年份 / 地区 / 题材 / 语言组合筛选。"
msgstr "Get a movie list by category, with pagination, sorting, and combined year / region / genre / language filters."

msgid "按时间"
msgstr "By Time"

msgid "按评分"
msgstr "By Rating"

msgid "排序方式"
msgstr "Sort By"

msgid "搜索影片"
msgstr "Search Movies"

msgid "播放地址"
msgstr "Playback URL"

msgid "播放源序号"
msgstr "Source Index"

msgid "数据类信息（片名、简介、集数等）缓存时间较长；播放地址（m3u8）因为带时效只做较短缓存，请勿在客户端长期缓存播放地址。本服务需项目签名。"
msgstr "Metadata such as title, synopsis and episode count is cached for a long time, while playback URLs (m3u8) expire and are cached only briefly, so do not cache playback URLs on the client for long. This service requires project signature authentication."

msgid "源站地址直出，不做代理转发。"
msgstr "The source URL is returned directly without proxying."

msgid "用于搭建站点导航：main 为主分类，sub 为连续剧的子分类，返回的 id 都可直接传给「列表」接口的 type_id。"
msgstr "Use it to build site navigation: main holds the primary categories and sub holds the TV-series sub-categories; every returned id can be passed to the list endpoint as type_id."

msgid "电影"
msgstr "Movies"

msgid "电影API,影视API接口,免费电影接口,m3u8播放地址,影视解析API,影片搜索接口"
msgstr "Movie API,Video Streaming API,Free Movie API,m3u8 Playback URL,Movie Parser API,Movie Search API"

msgid "电影服务聚合影视站数据，提供分类、筛选条件、首页推荐、列表、详情、选集与播放地址（m3u8）等完整链路，按「分类 → 列表 → 详情 → 播放地址」的顺序即可搭起一个影视站，搜索接口则支持按片名关键词查片。"
msgstr "The movie service aggregates data from a film and TV site and provides the full chain of categories, filters, home recommendations, lists, details, episode lists and playback URLs (m3u8). Following \"category, list, detail, playback URL\" is enough to build a movie site, and the search endpoint looks titles up by keyword."

msgid "电影聚合服务：提供影视的分类、列表、详情、选集与播放地址（m3u8）能力，按「列表 → 详情 → 播放」流程即可搭建完整影视站。"
msgstr "Movie aggregation service: categories, lists, details, episode lists, and playback URLs (m3u8) for films and TV shows — build a complete streaming site with the \"list → detail → play\" flow."

msgid "筛选条件"
msgstr "Filters"

msgid "获取可用分类（主分类 / 子分类 / 专题）。"
msgstr "Get available categories (main categories / sub-categories / specials)."

msgid "获取影片详情：简介、导演/演员等元数据、播放源与选集列表。"
msgstr "Get movie details: synopsis, director / cast metadata, playback sources, and episode lists."

msgid "获取指定播放源/集数的 m3u8 播放地址。"
msgstr "Get the m3u8 playback URL for a given playback source and episode."

msgid "获取某分类可用的筛选条件：子分类、地区、题材、语言、年份、排序。"
msgstr "Get the filters available for a category: sub-categories, region, genre, language, year, and sort order."

msgid "获取首页聚合数据：轮播图与各推荐区块（本周/本月最佳、各榜单等）。"
msgstr "Get home feed data: the carousel and all recommendation blocks (best of the week / month, rankings, and more)."

msgid "语言"
msgstr "Language"

msgid "返回 data.items（影片列表）与 data.pagination（分页信息）。"
msgstr "Returns data.items (movie list) and data.pagination (pagination info)."

msgid "返回 data.m3u8 为可播放地址；该地址带时效，已做较短缓存（默认 30 分钟）。"
msgstr "data.m3u8 is a playable URL; it is time-limited, so it is cached only briefly (30 minutes by default)."

msgid "返回 data.results 影片列表，字段与列表接口一致。"
msgstr "Returns data.results (movie list) with the same fields as the list endpoint."

msgid "返回 data.sources（播放源），每个源含 episodes（选集），选集里的 sid/nid 用于「播放地址」接口。"
msgstr "Returns data.sources (playback sources); each source contains episodes, whose sid / nid are used by the playback URL endpoint."

msgid "返回 data.sub_types（子分类，value 回传给 type_id）与 data.groups。"
msgstr "Returns data.sub_types (sub-categories; pass value back as type_id) and data.groups."

msgid "集数序号"
msgstr "Episode Index"

msgid "页面下方提供在线播放器：请求成功后自动加载播放，也可粘贴任意 m3u8 地址测试。"
msgstr "An online player is provided below: it auto-plays after a successful request, and you can also paste any m3u8 URL to test."

msgid "题材"
msgstr "Genre"

msgid "首页聚合"
msgstr "Home Feed"

msgid "默认"
msgstr "Default"

