msgstr "Series Name"

msgid "剧集详情"
msgstr "Series Details"

msgid "可选：榜单类型，默认 hot-drama（热播榜）。"
msgstr "Optional: ranking type, defaults to hot-drama."

msgid "实时爬取源站 SSR 数据并缓存。剧集元数据/集列表缓存较久；播放直链缓存较短。"
msgstr "Crawls the source site's SSR data in real time and caches it. Series metadata / episode lists are cached longer; playback links are cached briefly."

msgid "必填：分类取值 —— 一级 slug（如 real-drama）或「一级/二级」（如 real-drama/romance），完整取值见「分类清单」接口。"
msgstr "Required: the category — a top-level slug (e.g. real-drama) or \"top-level/sub\" (e.g. real-drama/romance); see the category list endpoint for the full set."

msgid "必填：剧集 ID（取自列表/搜索结果）。"
msgstr "Required: series ID (from list / search results)."

msgid "必填：搜索关键词（剧名）。"
msgstr "Required: search keyword (series title)."

msgid "必填：集数，从 1 开始。"
msgstr "Required: episode number, starting from 1."

msgid "按关键词搜索短剧。"
msgstr "Search short dramas by keyword."

msgid "按分类获取短剧列表，支持分页。"
msgstr "Get a short-drama list by category, with pagination."

msgid "播放接口返回的源站直链为 MP4 且带时效，请勿在客户端长期缓存；剧集元数据与集列表缓存较久，播放直链缓存较短以便及时刷新。本服务需项目签名。"
msgstr "Direct source links returned by the playback endpoint are MP4 and time-limited — do not cache them on the client. Series metadata and episode lists are cached longer; playback links are cached briefly so they stay fresh. This service requires project signature."

msgid "播放能力：前 3 集由源站直接下发明文直链；第 4 集及以后源站只下发 DRM 加密的H.265（浏览器无法直接解码），由本服务在服务端解密并转成 H.264 后出流，播放接口返回的地址可直接交给浏览器的「视频」标签播放，支持拖动进度条。第 4 集及以后首次点播需等待数十秒生成，之后即刻返回。"
msgstr "Playback: the first 3 episodes come as plain direct links from the source site. From episode 4 on the source only delivers DRM-encrypted H.265, which browsers cannot decode, so this service decrypts and transcodes it to H.264 and streams it. The URL returned by the playback endpoint can be handed straight to a browser <video> tag and supports seeking. The first play of episode 4 or later waits tens of seconds while it is generated; later plays are immediate."

msgid "榜单类型"
msgstr "Ranking Type"

msgid "榜单类型非法时返回 PARAM_VALUE_INVALID。"
msgstr "Returns PARAM_VALUE_INVALID when the ranking type is invalid."

msgid "源站搜索不支持分页，恒返回单页（page 传入也仅返回同一批结果）。"
msgstr "The source site does not paginate search; a single page is always returned (passing page still yields the same results)."

msgid "源站直链带时效，请勿长期缓存。"
msgstr "Direct source links are time-limited — do not cache them long-term."

