msgid "按服务、接口、接入项目与时段统计调用量：成功率 / 失败率、时段分布、峰值与环比一屏可见；支持按服务与项目筛选。数据按天全量、按小时近 90 天预聚合，写入最多延迟数秒。"
msgstr "Call volume by service, Endpoint, integrated project and hour: success/failure rates, hourly distribution, peaks and period-over-period comparison on one screen, with filtering by service and project. Daily data is kept in full and hourly data for the last 90 days; writes may lag by a few seconds."

msgid "接入项目"
msgstr "Integrated Project"

