msgid "该接口历史累计调用次数（未登录也可见）"
msgstr "Total calls for this Endpoint (visible without logging in)"

msgid "该时间范围内暂无调用数据"
msgstr "No call data in this period"

msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

msgid "调用统计服务对外公开每个接口的调用量：可以查某个接口被调用了多少次（累计与今日），也可以查各服务的调用量排行，适合做公开的运营数据展示，或写入自己的监控面板。"
msgstr "The statistics service publicly exposes call counts per endpoint: query how many times an endpoint has been called (total and today), or view a ranking of services by call volume. It is useful for public dashboards or your own monitoring panel."

msgid "调用量为公开信息，接口开放（免签名）。数据按天聚合，写入最多延迟数秒；统计范围仅 /api/ 业务接口，认证被拒与未匹配路由同样计入。"
msgstr "Call volume is public information, so this Endpoint is open (no signature required). Data is aggregated daily, so writes may lag by a few seconds; only /api/ Endpoints are counted, including rejected authentication and unmatched routes."

msgid "调用量查询"
msgstr "Call Volume Query"

msgid "超级管理员,调用统计,API 统计,成功率,时段分布"
msgstr "Super Admin,call statistics,API statistics,success rate,hourly distribution"

