msgid "返回各服务的累计与今日调用次数，按累计调用量降序。"
msgstr "Returns each service's total and today's call count, sorted by total call volume descending."

msgid "返回某个接口的累计调用次数与今日调用次数。"
msgstr "Returns the total and today's call count of an Endpoint."

msgid "这是本站唯一无需签名的开放服务，未登录也能直接调用。统计口径只包含调用次数，不包含调用方项目、失败率与耗时等敏感信息。"
msgstr "This is the only open service on the site that requires no signature, and it can be called without logging in. The figures cover call counts only; no caller project, failure rate or latency information is exposed."


