# ==================== 超级管理控制台 · 服务策略（服务 / 线路 / 端点三级继承） ====================
msgid "服务策略"
msgstr "Service Policies"

msgid "服务策略 - 超级管理员 - 小影API"
msgstr "Service Policies - Super Admin - XiaoYingAPI"

msgid "超级管理员,服务策略,状态,认证模式,项目白名单,三级继承"
msgstr "Super Admin,service policies,status,auth mode,project whitelist,three-level inheritance"

msgid "小影API 超级管理员：按服务 / 线路 / 端点三级配置认证模式与对外状态，逐级继承。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI Super Admin: configure auth mode and public status by service / channel / endpoint, inherited level by level."

msgid "共 %(total)s 条策略；服务 / 线路 / 端点三级逐级继承，改动后立即对接口鉴权生效，无需重启。"
msgstr "%(total)s policies in total; service / channel / endpoint inherit level by level. Changes take effect on API authentication immediately — no restart needed."

msgid "逐级继承：服务 → 线路 → 端点，每一级都可单独设状态 / 认证模式 / 项目范围 / 文档可见性 / 使用范围；设为「跟随上级」则向上一级取，最终兜底为「正常 + 需要签名 + 不限项目 + 文档展示 + 正常」。"
msgstr "Level-by-level inheritance: Service → Channel → Endpoint. Each level can set status / auth mode / project scope / docs visibility / audience independently; \"Inherit\" takes the value from the level above, and the final fallback is \"Active + Auth Required + All projects + Visible in Docs + Normal\"."

msgid "维护态：生效状态为「维护中」时，命中路径的 /api/ 请求统一返回 30004「服务维护中」，且不做签名校验（匿名同样收到）。"
msgstr "Maintenance: when the effective status is \"Under Maintenance\", every /api/ request under the matched path returns 30004 \"Service under maintenance\", with no signature check (anonymous callers get it too)."

msgid "开发中 / 已下线只作前台展示标记，不拦截请求（便于排障与联调）。"
msgstr "\"In Development\" / \"Offline\" are display-only markers on the public site; they do not block requests (to ease troubleshooting and integration testing)."

msgid "项目白名单：仅在生效认证模式为「需要签名」时生效——签名通过后若当前项目不在名单内，返回 20020「无权限」；开放模式不校验签名，拿不到调用项目。"
msgstr "Project whitelist: applies only when the effective auth mode is \"Auth Required\". After the signature is verified, a project not on the list gets 20020 (Forbidden). Open mode skips the signature check, so the calling project is unknown."

msgid "文档可见性：生效值「文档隐藏」的路径不会出现在官网文档中心与在线调试中（后台内部接口用）。"
msgstr "Docs visibility: paths whose effective value is \"Hidden from Docs\" do not appear in the public docs center or the live debugger (for internal back-office APIs)."

msgid "使用范围：生效值「仅专属管理员」的路径仅供后台内部使用，对外调用一律返回 20020「无权限」（不区分是否带签名）。"
msgstr "Audience: paths whose effective value is \"Super Admin Only\" are for internal back-office use only; external calls always return 20020 (Forbidden), with or without a signature."

msgid "未命中任何策略的 /api/ 路径按全局默认「需要签名」处理（fail-closed）。"
