msgstr "The images / videos / audios parameters are accepted only when ticked; the count limits apply only to the corresponding capability, and going over them returns an invalid-value error. Videos use a video_url block and audio uses an input_audio block, both requiring upstream models that support the capability (e.g. Doubao Seed 2.0 omni-modal)."

