msgid "多模型 AI 对话接口：用 model 参数在多家厂商的模型间切换，单轮 / 多轮、流式、图片 / 视频 / 音频理解（部分模型）一应俱全。"
msgstr "Multi-model AI chat API: switch between models from several vendors with the model parameter — single-turn, multi-turn, streaming and image/video/audio understanding (on supported models)."

msgid "AI API,免费AI接口,大模型API,AI对话接口,DeepSeek API,Kimi API,豆包API,千问API"
msgstr "AI API,free AI API,LLM API,AI chat API,DeepSeek API,Kimi API,Doubao API,Qwen API"

msgid "AI 服务提供开箱即用的对话能力，已接入多家厂商的模型（当前含 DeepSeek）；平台侧统一持有各厂商密钥，调用方无需自行申请与配置，适合做内容生成、摘要、问答等功能的快速验证。"
msgstr "The AI service offers chat capabilities out of the box, with models from several vendors (currently DeepSeek). The platform holds the vendor keys, so callers need no application or configuration of their own — handy for quickly validating content generation, summarisation or Q&A features."

msgid "切换模型只需改 model 一个参数，接口地址、鉴权方式与响应结构完全不变：候选模型见下方「模型清单」接口，或直接看 chat 端点的 model 下拉。新增模型由超管在后台添加，对大模型厂商的差异（上游地址、密钥、能力）全部在服务端收口。"
msgstr "Switching models takes only the model parameter: the endpoint, authentication and response shape stay identical. See the Model List endpoint below, or the model dropdown on the chat endpoint. New models are added by a super admin in the console; all vendor differences (upstream URL, key, capabilities) are absorbed server-side."

msgid "标记了「支持视觉」的模型可以额外传 images（公网图片地址）让它看图回答；标记了「支持视频理解」的模型还能传 videos（公网视频地址，如豆包 Seed 2.0 全模态）让它看视频、连音轨一起理解；标记了「支持音频理解」的模型还可以传 audios（公网音频地址）做语音转写与音频内容理解；未标记的模型传图片、视频或音频会返回参数值非法，避免把参数静默丢掉。"
msgstr "Models marked as vision-capable also accept images (public image URLs) so they can answer about a picture; models marked as video-capable additionally accept videos (public video URLs, e.g. Doubao Seed 2.0 omni-modal) so they can watch the video and understand its audio track too; models marked as audio-capable also accept audios (public audio URLs) for speech transcription and audio understanding; models without these flags return an invalid-value error instead of silently dropping the parameter."

msgid "本服务需项目签名。开启流式（stream=true）后返回的是逐段推送的 SSE 内容，与普通 JSON 响应的呈现方式不同，在文档页在线调试时可直接看到。"
msgstr "This service requires a project signature. With streaming enabled (stream=true) the response is a chunked SSE stream rather than plain JSON; you can watch it in the live debugger here."

msgid "平台内置密钥（DeepSeek / 月之暗面 / 火山方舟 / 阿里云百炼等，均可后台扩展）"
msgstr "Platform-managed keys (DeepSeek / Moonshot / Volcengine Ark / Alibaba Bailian and more, extendable in the console)"

msgid "images 仅对「支持视觉」的模型有效，其它模型传了返回参数值非法（20003）；张数上限由平台按模型配置（后台可调），超限同样返回参数值非法。"
msgstr "The images parameter works only for vision-capable models; other models return an invalid-value error (20003). The number of images is capped per model on the platform (adjustable in the console); exceeding the cap returns the same invalid-value error."

msgid "videos 仅对「支持视频理解」的模型有效（如豆包 Seed 2.0 全模态，可同时理解画面与音轨），其它模型传了返回参数值非法（20003）；数量上限同样由平台按模型配置，超限返回参数值非法。"
msgstr "videos works only for video-capable models (e.g. Doubao Seed 2.0 omni-modal, which understands both the picture and the audio track); other models return an invalid-value error (20003). The video count limit is likewise configured per model by the platform, and going over it returns an invalid-value error."

msgid "audios 仅对「支持音频理解」的模型有效（如豆包 Seed 2.0 全模态，可做语音转写与音频内容理解），其它模型传了返回参数值非法（20003）；个数上限同样由平台按模型配置，超限返回参数值非法。"
msgstr "audios works only for audio-capable models (e.g. Doubao Seed 2.0 omni-modal, for speech transcription and audio understanding); other models return an invalid-value error (20003). The audio count limit is likewise configured per model by the platform, and going over it returns an invalid-value error."

msgid "在线调用会真实消耗上游额度，请确认平台密钥可用后再调试。"
msgstr "Live debugging really consumes upstream quota — make sure the platform key works first."

msgid "原「前缀续写（prefix / prefix_content）」能力已下线，传入会返回参数值非法。"
msgstr "The former prefix-completion capability (prefix / prefix_content) has been retired; passing it returns an invalid-value error."

msgid "列出平台当前可用的模型（标识、展示名、是否支持视觉/视频/音频、是否为默认模型）。"
msgstr "List the models currently available on the platform (key, display name, vision/video/audio support, whether it is the default)."

msgid "用于让调用方动态发现可选模型，避免把模型名写死在客户端。"
msgstr "Lets callers discover available models dynamically instead of hardcoding model names in the client."

msgid "只返回模型自身信息：不含厂商、上游地址与密钥。"
msgstr "Returns model information only: no vendor, upstream URL or key."

msgid "请求不传 model 时使用 is_default 为 true 的那个模型。"
msgstr "Requests that omit model use the entry whose is_default is true."

msgid "选填：不传则使用平台默认模型；候选清单来自平台（见「模型清单」接口）"
msgstr "Optional: omit to use the platform default model. Candidates come from the platform (see the Model List endpoint)."

msgid "[\"https://xxx.com/a.jpg\"]"
msgstr "[\"https://xxx.com/a.jpg\"]"

msgid "[\"https://xxx.com/a.mp4\"]"
msgstr "[\"https://xxx.com/a.mp4\"]"

msgid "[\"https://xxx.com/a.mp3\"]"
msgstr "[\"https://xxx.com/a.mp3\"]"

msgid "选填：仅「支持视觉」的模型可传；JSON 数组或纯文本（换行/逗号分隔）的公网图片地址，张数上限由平台按模型配置（后台可调）"
msgstr "Optional: only for models marked as vision-capable. Public image URLs as a JSON array or plain text (newline/comma separated); the per-model image cap is configured on the platform (adjustable in the console)."

msgid "选填：仅「支持视频理解」的模型可传（如豆包 Seed 2.0 全模态）；JSON 数组或纯文本（换行/逗号分隔）的公网视频地址，数量上限由平台按模型配置（后台可调）"
msgstr "Optional: only for models marked as video-capable (e.g. Doubao Seed 2.0 omni-modal). Public video URLs as a JSON array or plain text (newline/comma separated); the per-model video cap is configured on the platform (adjustable in the console)."

msgid "选填：仅「支持音频理解」的模型可传（如豆包 Seed 2.0 全模态）；JSON 数组或纯文本（换行/逗号分隔）的公网音频地址，个数上限由平台按模型配置（后台可调）。音频文件可先经「文件上传」服务上传，再把返回地址传到这里"
msgstr "Optional: only for models marked as audio-capable (e.g. Doubao Seed 2.0 omni-modal). Public audio URLs as a JSON array or plain text (newline/comma separated); the per-model audio cap is configured on the platform (adjustable in the console). Upload the audio via the File Upload service first, then pass the returned URL here."

msgid "选填：传了就用调用方自己的 Key（须与所选模型所属厂商一致），不传则用平台密钥"
msgstr "Optional: pass your own key (it must belong to the vendor of the chosen model); otherwise the platform key is used."

