msgstr "AI Models"

msgid "维护 AI 厂商与模型（上游地址、平台密钥、模型能力），调用方只需选模型即可无缝切换。"
msgstr "Manage AI vendors and models (base URL, platform key, capabilities); callers just pick a model to switch seamlessly."

