msgid "超级管理员,AI 模型,厂商,大模型,系统提示词,模型能力,视觉"
msgstr "Super Admin,AI models,vendors,LLM,system prompts,model capabilities,vision"

msgid "小影API 超级管理员：维护 AI 厂商、模型与系统提示词（上游地址、平台密钥、模型能力、采样参数），供 /api/ai/ 统一调用。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI Super Admin: manage AI vendors, models and system prompts (upstream base URL, platform API key, model capabilities, sampling parameters) used by the unified /api/ai/ endpoints."

msgid "系统提示词：可在下方提示词区建多套，其中一套勾「全局共享」；每个模型可单独选择「跟随全局 / 不使用 / 指定某一条」。调用方自带 system_prompt 时以调用方为准。"
msgstr "System prompts: create several in the section below and tick \"shared globally\" on one of them; each model can then pick \"follow global / no prompt / a specific one\". When the caller supplies system_prompt, the caller wins."

msgid "采样参数（温度 / 最大回复长度 / 停止词）按模型配置，留空即不下发该参数；调用方无法自定义，请求里带了会被拒绝。"
msgstr "Sampling parameters (temperature / max reply length / stop words) are configured per model; leaving one blank means it is not sent. Callers cannot override them — passing one is rejected."

msgid "提示词 / 采样"
msgstr "Prompt / Sampling"

msgid "不使用提示词"
msgstr "No prompt"

msgid "跟随全局共享"
msgstr "Follow global"

msgid "系统提示词"
msgstr "System prompt"

msgid "新建提示词"
msgstr "New Prompt"

msgid "勾「全局共享」的那一条会被所有「跟随全局」的模型使用（全局只保留一条）；停用后视同不存在，指定它的模型会自动回落到全局那条。"
msgstr "The one ticked \"shared globally\" is used by every model set to \"follow global\" (only one can be global). A disabled prompt is treated as nonexistent, so models bound to it fall back to the global one."

msgid "正文预览"
msgstr "Preview"

msgid "全局共享"
msgstr "Shared globally"

msgid "使用它的模型"
msgstr "Models using it"

msgid "设为全局共享"
msgstr "Make global"

msgid "删除后不可恢复；指定它的模型会自动回落到全局共享那条，确认删除？"
msgstr "This cannot be undone; models bound to it will fall back to the globally shared prompt. Delete anyway?"

msgid "删除提示词"
msgstr "Delete prompt"

msgid "暂无系统提示词；不配置时请求不带 system 消息，模型按自身默认行为作答。"
msgstr "No system prompts yet. Without one, requests carry no system message and models answer with their own defaults."

msgid "新建系统提示词"
msgstr "New System Prompt"

msgid "编辑系统提示词"
msgstr "Edit System Prompt"

msgid "共 %(p)s 个厂商、%(m)s 个模型、%(s)s 套系统提示词；调用方只需选 model，其余（地址、密钥、提示词、采样参数）由这里驱动。"
msgstr "%(p)s vendor(s), %(m)s model(s), %(s)s system prompt(s); callers only pick a model — the rest (URLs, keys, prompts, sampling) is driven from here."

msgid "温度 %(v)s"
msgstr "Temp %(v)s"

msgid "上限 %(v)s"
msgstr "Max %(v)s"

msgid "最多 %(v)s 张"
msgstr "Up to %(v)s"

msgid "不使用系统提示词"
msgstr "No system prompt"

msgid "（已停用）"
msgstr " (disabled)"

msgid "调用方自带 system_prompt 时以调用方为准，本项只在调用方没带时生效。提示词在下方「系统提示词」区维护。"
msgstr "When the caller supplies system_prompt, the caller wins; this setting only applies when they do not. Prompts are managed in the \"System prompts\" section below."

msgid "采样参数（可选）：留空表示不下发该参数、由上游默认值决定。调用方无法自定义，要调整只能改这里。"
msgstr "Sampling parameters (optional): blank means the parameter is not sent and the upstream default applies. Callers cannot override them, so adjust them here."

msgid "多个用逗号分隔，如 END,STOP"
msgstr "Separate several with commas, e.g. END,STOP"

msgid "指定：%(n)s"
msgstr "Use: %(n)s"

msgid "提示词名称"
msgstr "Prompt name"

msgid "如：通用助手 / 严格 JSON 输出"
msgstr "e.g. General assistant / Strict JSON output"

msgid "提示词正文（纯文本，会作为 system 消息发给模型）"
msgstr "Prompt text (plain text, sent to the model as the system message)"

msgid "如：你是小影API 的 AI 助手，回答要准确、简洁；涉及代码时用 Markdown 代码块。"
msgstr "e.g. You are the XiaoYingAPI AI assistant: be accurate and concise, and use Markdown code blocks for code."

msgid "全局共享（所有「跟随全局」的模型都用它；全局只保留一条）"
msgstr "Shared globally (used by every model set to \"follow global\"; only one can be global)"

msgid "启用（停用后视同不存在，指定它的模型会回落到全局共享那条）"
msgstr "Enabled (a disabled prompt is treated as nonexistent; models bound to it fall back to the globally shared one)"

msgid "采样温度必须为数字（留空表示不设置）"
msgstr "Temperature must be a number (leave blank to not set it)"

msgid "采样温度取值范围为 0 ~ 2"
msgstr "Temperature must be between 0 and 2"

msgid "最大回复长度取值范围为 1 ~ 32768（留空表示不设置）"
msgstr "Max reply length must be between 1 and 32768 (leave blank to not set it)"

msgid "最多图片数取值范围为 1 ~ %(limit)s"
msgstr "Max images must be between 1 and %(limit)s"

msgid "停止词过长，请控制在 255 个字符以内"
msgstr "Stop words are too long; keep them within 255 characters"

msgid "选择的系统提示词不存在，请重新选择"
msgstr "The selected system prompt no longer exists; please choose again"

msgid "请填写提示词名称"
msgstr "Please enter a prompt name"

msgid "请填写提示词正文"
msgstr "Please enter the prompt text"

msgid "系统提示词「%(name)s」已创建"
msgstr "System prompt \"%(name)s\" created"

msgid "系统提示词「%(name)s」已保存"
msgstr "System prompt \"%(name)s\" saved"

msgid "系统提示词「%(name)s」已启用"
msgstr "System prompt \"%(name)s\" enabled"

msgid "系统提示词「%(name)s」已停用，停用期间视同不存在"
msgstr "System prompt \"%(name)s\" disabled; while disabled it is treated as nonexistent"

msgid "已把「%(name)s」设为全局共享提示词"
msgstr "\"%(name)s\" is now the globally shared prompt"

msgid "系统提示词「%(name)s」已删除"
msgstr "System prompt \"%(name)s\" deleted"

msgid "系统提示词不存在"
msgstr "System prompt not found"

msgid "同一个接口覆盖单轮与多轮对话：传 content 发起简单单轮问答，传 messages（JSON 数组，含 role 与 content）则进行多轮对话；同时支持流式输出。"
msgstr "One endpoint covers both single-turn and multi-turn chats: send content for a quick single question, or messages (a JSON array with role and content) for multi-turn; streaming output is supported as well."

msgid "系统提示词由平台按模型统一配置（超管在后台维护，可设多套并指定某个模型用哪一套），调用方不需要、也不能改生成策略——采样温度、最大回复长度、停止词同样由平台控制，接口不接受这些参数，从而保证所有接入方拿到的行为一致、可控。"
msgstr "System prompts are configured per model by the platform (an admin maintains several and assigns one to each model). Callers need not — and cannot — change the generation strategy: temperature, max reply length and stop words are likewise platform-controlled and not accepted as request parameters, so every integrator gets the same, predictable behaviour."

msgid "本服务需项目签名。开启流式（stream=true）后返回的是逐段推送的 SSE 内容，与普通 JSON 响应的呈现方式不同，在文档页在线调试时会逐字打印出来。"
msgstr "This service requires project signature authentication. With streaming enabled (stream=true) the response is pushed as SSE chunks rather than a single JSON body, and the live debugger on this page prints it character by character."

