# ==================== 官网文案更新：额度计费说明（首页 / 文档中心 / 接入向导） ====================
msgid "按次计费 · 点数余额"
msgstr "Pay-per-call · Point Balance"

msgid "调用按次消耗项目额度（点数），单价以文档页标价为准。"
msgstr "Calls consume project credits (points) per request; prices are shown on each docs page."

msgid "每个端点标注单价"
msgstr "Price shown on every endpoint"

msgid "使用用户名、邮箱或手机号注册小影API账号，注册与登录均免费。"
msgstr "Sign up for a XiaoYingAPI account with a username, email, or phone number — registration and login are free."

msgid "创建接入项目"
msgstr "Create a Project"

msgid "登录后在「我的项目」自助创建，立即获得专属 APPID 与 APPSECRET，创建项目免费。"
msgstr "Sign in and create one yourself under \"My Projects\" to get a dedicated APPID and APPSECRET right away — creating a project is free."

msgid "充值额度并调用"
msgstr "Top Up Credits and Start Calling"

msgid "为项目充值点数后即可调用（新项目默认 0 额度）；成功后按次扣点、失败不扣，统一 <code class=\"font-mono text-xs\">{ code, msg, data }</code> 响应。"
msgstr "Top up points for your project to start calling (new projects default to 0 credits); successful calls deduct points per request and failed calls are not charged, all returning a unified <code class=\"font-mono text-xs\">{ code, msg, data }</code> response."

msgid "调用接口要收费吗？额度怎么算？"
msgstr "Does calling the APIs cost money? How are credits calculated?"

msgid "注册、登录、创建项目与浏览文档均免费。调用接口按次消耗项目额度（点数），单价以接口文档页标价为准（未单独配置的服务默认 1 点/次）；只有调用成功才扣点，失败不扣。新建项目默认 0 额度，额度不足时无法调用接口（开放接口除外），请联系管理员充值。"
msgstr "Registering, logging in, creating projects, and browsing the docs are all free. Calling APIs consumes project credits (points) per request, priced as shown on each docs page (services without a specific price default to 1 point per call); points are deducted only on success, never on failure. New projects start with 0 credits, and APIs cannot be called when credits run out (except open APIs) — contact an administrator to top up."

msgid "登录后在「我的项目」页自助创建接入项目，创建后即可看到 APPID / APPSECRET，创建项目免费。APPSECRET 请务必保存在你的服务端，严禁写入前端代码或提交到仓库。"
msgstr "Sign in and create a project yourself on the \"My Projects\" page; APPID / APPSECRET appear right away, and creating a project is free. Always keep APPSECRET on your server — never put it in front-end code or commit it to a repository."

msgid "小影API 是一个通用 API 聚合服务平台，聚合音乐、视频解析、AI、代理IP、验证码、短信、邮箱、用户中心等 %(n)s 类服务能力，统一签名认证与标准 JSON 响应，注册免费、调用按次消耗项目额度（点数）。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI is a Unified API Aggregation Platform that aggregates %(n)s categories of services including music, video parsing, AI, proxy IP, CAPTCHA, SMS, email, and user center, with Unified Signature Auth and Standard JSON Response — free to register, with each call consuming project credits (points)."

msgid "登录后在「我的项目」自助创建，立即获得专属 APPID 与 APPSECRET（新建项目默认 0 额度，创建免费）。"
msgstr "Sign in and create one yourself under \"My Projects\" to get a dedicated APPID and APPSECRET right away (new projects default to 0 credits; creating one is free)."

msgid "充值额度并接入生产"
msgstr "Top Up Credits and Go to Production"

msgid "为项目充值点数后即可调用（成功按次扣点、失败不扣）；在上线前于服务端实现 HMAC-SHA256 签名，密钥放进环境变量，绝不进前端。"
msgstr "Top up points for your project to start calling (points are deducted per successful call, never on failure); before going live, implement HMAC-SHA256 signing on your server and keep the secret in environment variables — never in the frontend."

msgid "② 创建接入项目"
msgstr "② Create a Project"

msgid "登录后在「我的项目」自助创建项目；创建后"
msgstr "Sign in and create a project yourself under \"My Projects\"; after creation, "

msgid "APPID 是公开标识；APPSECRET 是签名密钥，只应保存在你的服务端。泄露可在「我的项目」详情页一键重置。"
msgstr "APPID is a public identifier; APPSECRET is the signing secret and must only be kept on your server. If it leaks, you can reset it in one click on the project's \"My Projects\" detail page."

msgid "④ 充值额度"
msgstr "④ Top Up Credits"

msgid "新建项目默认 0 额度，调用接口前需联系管理员为项目充值点数；成功调用按次扣点，失败不扣。"
msgstr "New projects default to 0 credits; contact an administrator to top up points before calling APIs. Successful calls deduct points per request and failed calls are not charged."

msgid "调用接口要额度吗？怎么计费？"
msgstr "Do API calls need credits? How is billing calculated?"

msgid "注册、登录、创建项目与浏览文档均免费。调用接口按次消耗项目额度（点数），单价以接口文档页标价为准（未单独配置的服务默认 1 点/次）；只有调用成功（业务码 10000）才扣点，失败不扣。新建项目默认 0 额度，调用前需联系管理员充值；余额不足时接口返回 30012，开放接口（免签名）不受额度限制。"
msgstr "Registering, logging in, creating projects, and browsing the docs are all free. Calling APIs consumes project credits (points) per request, priced as shown on each docs page (services without a specific price default to 1 point per call); points are deducted only on success (business code 10000), never on failure. New projects start with 0 credits — contact an administrator to top up before calling; insufficient balance returns 30012, while open (signature-free) APIs are not subject to credit limits."

msgid "10000=成功；20001/20002/20003=参数缺失/格式错误/值非法；20011=签名或认证失败；20040=触发频率限制（如登录连续失败被临时锁定）；30012=额度不足（项目余额低于本次调用单价，请充值）；40001=外部服务调用失败（请稍后重试或核对被调用的第三方资源）。"
msgstr "10000 = Success; 20001/20002/20003 = Missing parameter / Invalid format / Illegal value; 20011 = Signature or authentication failure; 20040 = Rate limit triggered (e.g. temporarily locked after repeated login failures); 30012 = Insufficient credits (project balance below the price of this call, please top up); 40001 = External service call failed (retry later or check the third-party resource being called)."

