# ==================== 问题反馈中心 · 服务卡片与文档中心正文（声明式数据的 localize） ====================

msgid "统一问题反馈中心：任何接入项目放一个链接或 iframe 即可接入（子项目零代码），用户提交建议 / 升级 / 问题 / BUG 并可携带图片与视频，AI 先审内容、管理员后台回复，每个项目还能展示各自的开发者联系方式。"
msgstr "A unified feedback center: any connected project can join by placing a link or an iframe (no code on your side). Users send suggestions, upgrade requests, questions or bugs with images and videos, the AI reviews the content first, admins reply from the console, and every project can publish its own developer contacts."

msgid "零代码接入"
msgstr "No-code integration"

msgid "AI审核"
msgstr "AI review"

msgid "统一的问题反馈调度中心：任何接入项目放一个链接或 iframe 即可接入（零代码），用户提交建议 / 升级 / 问题 / BUG 并可带图片与视频，AI 先审内容、管理员后台回复。"
msgstr "A unified feedback hub: any connected project joins with a single link or iframe (no code), users submit suggestions, upgrade requests, questions or bugs with images and videos, and the AI reviews content before admins reply."

msgid "反馈API,工单接口,问题反馈中心,用户反馈系统,接入即用"
msgstr "feedback API,ticket API,feedback center,user feedback system,ready to integrate"

msgid "「问题反馈中心」是一套**统一的、所有接入项目共用**的反馈调度中心。接入非常简单——子项目零代码：只要在页面上放一个指向 /feedback/<你的 APPID>/ 的链接（或把它塞进 iframe）即可，反馈表单、附件上传、AI 审核、公开区与开发者联系方式都由本服务托管，你不需要写任何提交逻辑，也不需要保存任何反馈数据。"
msgstr "The Feedback Center is a **unified hub shared by every connected project**. Integration is deliberately trivial — no code on the sub-project side: just put a link to /feedback/<your APPID>/ on your page (or embed it in an iframe). The submission form, attachment upload, AI review, public area and developer contacts are all hosted by this service; you write no submission logic and store no feedback data."

msgid "用户侧流程：选择反馈类型（功能建议 / 功能升级 / 使用问题 / BUG 反馈 / 其他）→ 填写内容（无需标题）→ 选填图片与视频（张数、大小上限由后台统一配置）→ 提交。游客可直接匿名提交（需先通过图形验证码，并受同 IP 频率限制）；已登录用户提交会带上用户身份，登录后可查看「我的反馈」并继续追问。提交后状态为「待审核」，AI 审核通过后进入「待处理」，管理员回复后变为「已回复」。"
msgstr "The user flow: pick a feedback type (feature request / upgrade / usage question / bug / other) → write the message (no title needed) → optionally attach images and videos (count and size limits are configured centrally) → submit. Guests may submit anonymously (a captcha is required and per-IP rate limits apply); signed-in users submit with their identity and can revisit their feedback under \"My feedback\" to follow up. A new submission is \"Pending review\"; once the AI passes it, it becomes \"To process\"; after an admin replies it becomes \"Replied\"."

msgid "登录态怎么传给反馈页：子项目前端用用户自己的 UAC Token 调 POST /api/feedback/ticket换一张**一次性、5 分钟过期**的票据，把票据拼进反馈页地址（?ticket=xxx）作为链接或 iframe 地址；反馈页消费票据后建立会话，并 303 重定向到不带票据的干净地址。这样 UAC Token 不会落在 URL、浏览器历史与服务器访问日志里。游客无需票据，直接打开反馈页即可。"
msgstr "How the sign-in state reaches the feedback page: your frontend calls POST /api/feedback/ticket with the user's own UAC Token to obtain a **one-time, 5-minute** ticket, then appends it to the feedback page URL (?ticket=xxx) as a link or iframe address. The page consumes the ticket, establishes a session and 303-redirects to a clean URL without the ticket, so the UAC Token never lands in the URL, browser history or server access logs. Guests need no ticket — just open the feedback page."

msgid "**开发者联系方式的查看位置（三处）**：① 反馈页底部（/feedback/<app_id>/ 的「开发者联系方式」卡片）；② 公开区页面同样展示同一份联系方式；③ 子项目也可以在自己的页面上调用本服务的 GET /api/feedback/contacts?app_id=<APPID>（免签名）拿到这份数据，自行渲染。联系方式由超管在后台「问题反馈 → 反馈中心设置 → 各项目开发者联系方式」按项目分别维护，展示平台（QQ / QQ 邮箱 / 微信 / Telegram / WhatsApp / Discord 等）与具体值都可自定义，不同项目可以填不同的值。"
msgstr "**Where developer contacts are shown (three places)**: (1) at the bottom of the feedback page (the \"Developer contact\" card on /feedback/<app_id>/); (2) the public area page shows the same contacts; (3) your own page can call GET /api/feedback/contacts?app_id=<APPID> (no signature required) and render the data yourself. Contacts are maintained per project by the super admin under \"Feedback → Feedback center settings → Developer contacts per project\"; both the platforms shown (QQ / QQ Mail / WeChat / Telegram / WhatsApp / Discord, …) and the values are fully customisable, and different projects may use different values."

msgid "AI 审核说明：开关与两套提示词都在后台「反馈中心设置 → AI 审核」里配置（留空则使用内置通用规则）。**规则就是提示词**——后台写的规则会与反馈正文、提交者信息一起发给 AI，由 AI 判定是否驳回。提交内容的审核在后台线程里逐条慢慢审，不占用你的接口调用；平台没有配置可用 AI 模型时自动跳过审核，提交直接进入「待处理」。管理员回复前 AI 也会审一遍语气，但**只提醒、不阻断**，管理员可以修改后重发，也可以强制发送（强制发送会记入审核留痕）。若某条反馈因故没审到（例如审核调用失败），后台可以直接对它点「立即送审」优先补审。"
msgstr "About AI review: the switch and both prompts live under \"Feedback center settings → AI review\" in the console (leave them empty to use the built-in generic rules). **The rules are the prompt** — whatever you write is sent to the AI together with the feedback text and submitter info, and the AI decides whether to reject. Submissions are reviewed one by one by a background thread, so they never consume your API calls; if no usable AI model is configured, review is skipped and the submission goes straight to \"To process\". Before an admin reply is sent the AI also reviews its tone, but it **only warns and never blocks** — the admin may edit and resend, or send it anyway (a forced send is recorded in the audit trail). If a submission somehow missed review (for example the call failed), the console offers a \"Review now\" action to re-run it with priority."

msgid "数据隔离与公开区：反馈数据按接入项目隔离，后台可按项目 / 状态 / 类型 / AI 审核状态筛选与搜索。每个项目还有一个「公开区」——只展示**游客提交且已通过审查**的反馈（不展示任何附件与提交者身份），供访客搜索是否已经有人提过同样的问题；管理员可随时把某条从公开区撤下。"
msgstr "Data isolation and the public area: feedback is isolated per connected project, and the console can filter and search by project / status / type / AI review state. Every project also gets a \"public area\" that shows only feedback **submitted by guests and already cleared by review** (no attachments and no submitter identity), so visitors can search whether someone already raised the same issue; admins can hide any entry from the public area at any time."

msgid "反馈中心（托管反馈页接入）"
msgstr "Feedback center (hosted page integration)"

msgid "站内反馈库（数据按接入项目隔离）"
msgstr "Built-in feedback store (data isolated per connected project)"

msgid "两个端点都免签名（服务策略里配成 open）：ticket 的凭证是调用方本来就持有的用户 UAC Token，contacts 是公开信息。提交、查看与回复都不走 /api/，而是在 /feedback/<app_id>/ 反馈页上由本站直接处理。"
msgstr "Both endpoints are signature-free (configured as open in the service policy): the credential for ticket is the user's own UAC Token, which the caller already holds, and contacts is public information. Submitting, browsing and replying never go through /api/ — they are handled directly by this site on the /feedback/<app_id>/ page."

msgid "换取反馈页一次性票据"
msgstr "Exchange for a one-time feedback page ticket"

msgid "用用户的 UAC Token 换一张一次性票据（5 分钟过期），子项目把它拼进反馈页地址即可让用户以登录身份提交反馈。"
msgstr "Exchange the user's UAC Token for a one-time ticket (valid for 5 minutes); append it to the feedback page URL so the user submits feedback while signed in."

msgid "用户登录 Token"
msgstr "User sign-in token"

msgid "用户在**你项目下**的 UAC Token（Token 绑定项目，跨项目的 Token 无效）"
msgstr "The user's UAC Token **for your project** (tokens are bound to a project, so a token from another project will not work)"

msgid "返回 data.ticket / data.expire_in / data.app_id / data.app_name。"
msgstr "Returns data.ticket / data.expire_in / data.app_id / data.app_name."

msgid "票据一次性且 5 分钟过期：用完或过期即废，重复使用会被忽略（反馈页按游客处理）。"
msgstr "The ticket is one-time and expires in 5 minutes: it becomes useless once used or expired, and a reused ticket is ignored (the page then treats the visitor as a guest)."

msgid "拼接方式：/feedback/<app_id>/?ticket=<ticket>，作为链接或 iframe 地址交浏览器打开。"
msgstr "How to append it: /feedback/<app_id>/?ticket=<ticket>, handed to the browser as a link or iframe address."

msgid "查询项目开发者联系方式"
msgstr "Get a project's developer contacts"

msgid "查询某个接入项目已启用的开发者联系方式（平台名 / 值 / 可点击链接），与反馈页底部展示的是同一份数据。"
msgstr "Look up the enabled developer contacts of a connected project (platform name / value / clickable link) — the same data shown at the bottom of the feedback page."

msgid "接入项目 APPID"
msgstr "Connected project APPID"

msgid "在后台「接入项目」里查到的 APPID"
msgstr "The APPID found under \"Connected projects\" in the console"

msgid "返回 data.contacts 数组，每项含 platform / name / icon / label / value / url；url 为空串表示该平台未配置跳转模板，此时按纯文本展示。"
msgstr "Returns a data.contacts array; each item has platform / name / icon / label / value / url. An empty url means the platform has no link template configured, in which case the value is shown as plain text."

msgid "平台被停用或该项目的该项被清空后，对应条目不再返回。"
msgstr "Once a platform is disabled or the project's value for it is cleared, that entry is no longer returned."

