msgid "所有接口返回同一个 JSON 信封，业务数据都在 data 里："
msgstr "Every endpoint returns the same JSON envelope; the payload is always inside data:"

msgid "code：业务状态码，10000 表示成功；其余为各类错误，完整清单见「错误码」页。"
msgstr "code: business status code. 10000 means success; anything else is an error — see the Error Codes page for the full list."

msgid "msg：给人看的提示文案，可直接展示给终端用户，但不要用它做逻辑判断。"
msgstr "msg: a human-readable message you can show to end users, but never use it for program logic."

msgid "data：业务数据；出错时通常为 null。各接口 data 的具体字段见该接口的「响应说明」。"
msgstr "data: the payload; usually null on error. Each endpoint's Response section lists its data fields."

msgid "判断成功与否请看 code，不要依赖 HTTP 状态码。"
msgstr "Judge success by code, not by the HTTP status code."

msgid "查看完整错误码"
msgstr "View all error codes"

msgid "响应说明"
msgstr "Response"

msgid "外层统一格式"
msgstr "Common envelope"

msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

msgid "返回示例"
msgstr "Example response"

msgid "该接口未单独声明 data 结构，以上述外层统一格式为准。"
msgstr "This endpoint does not document its data structure separately; see the common envelope above."

msgid "错误码"
msgstr "Error Codes"

msgid "错误码 - 接口文档 - 小影API"
msgstr "Error Codes - API Docs - XiaoYingAPI"

msgid "错误码,状态码,API错误,小影API"
msgstr "Error codes,status codes,API errors,XiaoYingAPI"

msgid "小影API 对外错误码总表：按类别列出接口会返回的状态码、触发场景与处理建议。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI error code reference: the status codes the endpoints can return, grouped by category, with when they happen and what to do."

msgid "错误码总表"
msgstr "Error Code Reference"

msgid "所有接口统一返回 {code, msg, data} 信封，判断成功与否请看 code。本页按类别列出可能遇到的错误码、触发场景与处理建议。"
msgstr "Every endpoint returns a {code, msg, data} envelope; judge success by code. This page lists the error codes you may hit, grouped by category, with when they happen and what to do."

msgid "共 %(n)s 个错误码"
msgstr "%(n)s error codes"

msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

msgid "触发场景"
msgstr "When it happens"

msgid "处理建议"
msgstr "What to do"

msgid "遇到本页未列出的状态码，请连同请求参数与返回的 msg 一起反馈给我们。"
msgstr "If you hit a status code not listed here, report it to us together with your request parameters and the returned msg."

