msgstr "The global online-payment switch and exchange rate (points per yuan), each channel's merchant configuration (merchant ID / encrypted keys / available payment methods), the order list with manual query and refund, and the recent balance ledger."

msgid "商户私钥与平台公钥<strong>加密落库、页面不回显</strong>：输入框留空表示不修改，填了就整体替换并即时校验能否解析。当前有 %(pending)s 笔待支付订单、%(refunds)s 条待处理退款申请。"
msgstr "The merchant private key and platform public key are <strong>stored encrypted and never shown</strong>: leaving the inputs blank keeps the current value, filling them replaces it entirely and validates it immediately. There are %(pending)s pending orders and %(refunds)s refund requests awaiting manual handling."

msgid "支付成功只认「平台异步通知 + 主动查单」，页面跳转不算；回调会校验签名与订单金额，重复通知不会重复加钱。"
msgstr "Payment success is only recognised from the platform's async notification plus active order queries — a browser redirect never counts; callbacks verify the signature and the order amount, and repeated notifications never credit twice."

