msgid "必填。大于 0 的数字，两位小数；不得低于后台设置的单笔最低金额"
msgstr "Required. A number greater than 0 with two decimals; must not be below the per-order minimum set in the console"

msgid "如 1.00"
msgstr "e.g. 1.00"

