msgid "拿到返回后**按 `pay_type` 渲染**：`qrcode` 直接把 `pay_info` 做成二维码；`jump` 用浏览器 / WebView 打开 `pay_info`（收银台页自带二维码与付款入口）。实测同一笔微信支付在 `method=web` 下返回 `qrcode`，在 `method=jump` 下返回 https 收银台地址，故**不要硬编码某一种形态**。"
msgstr "After you get the response, **render according to `pay_type`**: for `qrcode` turn `pay_info` into a QR code; for `jump` open `pay_info` in a browser / WebView (the cashier page carries its own QR code and payment entry). In practice the same WeChat payment comes back as `qrcode` under `method=web` and as an https cashier URL under `method=jump`, so **do not hard-code either form**."

msgid "**到账只认异步回调与主动查单**：`return_url` 的页面跳转只代表用户看到了结果页，不能作为发货依据；请以 `query` 接口的 `paid` 或本站异步通知后的余额变化为准。"
msgstr "**Payment is recognised only from the asynchronous callback and an active query**: the `return_url` redirect merely means the user saw a result page and must not be used as proof of delivery; rely on `paid` from the `query` endpoint or on the balance change that follows this site's asynchronous notification."

msgid "**只扣一次**：同一订单重复回调 / 回调与查单同时命中时，本站用行锁 + 状态判断保证发货只发生一次。"
msgstr "**Charged only once**: when the same order triggers repeated callbacks, or a callback and a query land at the same time, this site uses a row lock plus a status check to guarantee that delivery happens exactly once."

msgid "**移动端无需自备二维码库**：用 `method=jump` 时返回的是普通网页地址，PC 浏览器、手机浏览器、WebView 都能直接打开。"
msgstr "**No QR code library needed on mobile**: with `method=jump` the response is an ordinary web URL that opens directly in a desktop browser, a mobile browser or a WebView."

msgid "**下单本身不消耗项目点数**（本服务单价为 0 点/次），因此余额为 0 的项目也能调用本接口给自己的项目充值。"
msgstr "**Creating an order costs no project points** (this service is priced at 0 points per call), so a project with zero balance can still call this endpoint to top itself up."

msgid "商户订单号（本站生成，查询 / 退款都用它）"
msgstr "Merchant order number (generated by this site; used by both query and refund)"

msgid "平台订单号（部分渠道下单时为空，付款后才有）"
msgstr "Platform order number (empty for some channels at creation time and filled in after payment)"

msgid "渠道标识，当前为 ezfp"
msgstr "Channel identifier, currently ezfp"

msgid "支付形态：qrcode=二维码内容 / jump=收银台地址"
msgstr "Payment form: qrcode=QR code content / jump=cashier URL"

msgid "金额（元，两位小数）"
msgstr "Amount (yuan, two decimals)"

msgid "订单状态：pending 待支付 / paid 已支付 / partial_refunded 部分退款 / refunded 已退款 / failed 下单失败 / closed 已关闭"
msgstr "Order status: pending (awaiting payment) / paid / partial_refunded / refunded / failed (order creation failed) / closed"

msgid "支付参数：pay_type=qrcode 时是二维码内容，jump 时是收银台地址"
msgstr "Payment parameter: the QR code content when pay_type=qrcode, the cashier URL when jump"

msgid "业务扩展参数，原样返回"
msgstr "Business extension parameter, returned verbatim"

msgid "按商户订单号查询订单，并把平台最新状态同步回本站（已支付会补发货）。"
msgstr "Look an order up by merchant order number and sync the platform's latest status back to this site (a paid order is delivered at that point)."

msgid "商户订单号"
msgstr "Merchant order number"

msgid "必填。下单接口返回的 out_trade_no"
msgstr "Required. The out_trade_no returned by the create-order endpoint"

msgid "只能查**本调用方自己**下的单：订单按 APPID 归属隔离，别人的单一律返回「订单不存在」。"
msgstr "You can only look up orders **created by your own caller**: orders are isolated by APPID owner, and someone else's order always comes back as \"order not found\"."

msgid "查到平台已支付且本站订单还没推进时，本接口会**当场补发货**（按后台汇率给调用项目加点数），因此「回调没收到」也能靠轮询查单兜底。"
msgstr "When the platform shows the order as paid while this site has not yet advanced it, this endpoint **delivers on the spot** (crediting the calling project's points at the rate configured in the console), so polling the query endpoint covers the case where the callback never arrived."

msgid "已下单后建议每 3～5 秒查一次，直到 `paid=true` 或超时；不必高频轮询，平台侧订单状态不会瞬间多次跳变。"
msgstr "After creating an order, poll once every 3–5 seconds until `paid=true` or you time out; there is no need to poll faster, since the platform-side order status does not change several times in an instant."

msgid "是否已支付（true 时订单已推进并发货）"
msgstr "Whether the order is paid (when true, the order has been advanced and delivered)"

msgid "订单退款"
msgstr "Refund order"

msgid "对已支付的订单发起退款；`amount` 留空表示退回剩余可退金额。"
msgstr "Refund a paid order; leaving `amount` empty refunds the remaining refundable amount."

msgid "必填。要退款的订单号"
msgstr "Required. The order number to refund"

msgid "退款金额（元）"
msgstr "Refund amount (yuan)"

msgid "留空=全额退剩余"
msgstr "empty = refund the remaining amount"

msgid "选填。不得大于可退金额（订单金额 − 已退金额）"
msgstr "Optional. Must not exceed the refundable amount (order amount − already refunded)"

msgid "只能退**本调用方自己**的订单。退款是否支持分笔、到账时长由支付平台与渠道决定，本接口只负责提交并把结果回写订单。"
msgstr "You can only refund **your own** orders. Whether partial refunds are allowed and how long the money takes to arrive are decided by the payment platform and the channel; this endpoint only submits the request and writes the result back to the order."

msgid "退款成功后本站订单状态变为 `refunded`（部分退款为 `partial_refunded`），累计退款额记在 `refund_amount`。"
msgstr "After a successful refund the order status becomes `refunded` (or `partial_refunded` for a partial refund), and the cumulative refunded amount is recorded in `refund_amount`."

msgid "⚠️ **已充进调用项目点数的订单退款，点数不会自动扣回** ——需要人工核账时请联系本站管理员。"
msgstr "⚠️ **Refunding an order whose amount has already been credited to the calling project's points does not claw those points back automatically** — contact this site's administrator if you need it reconciled manually."

msgid "累计已退款金额（元）"
msgstr "Cumulative refunded amount (yuan)"

# ==================== 支付：退款申请（人工受理）与「方式」列的中文展示 ====================

msgid "退款申请"
msgstr "Refund requests"

