msgstr "The APPID is a public identifier; the APPSECRET is the signing key and must be kept only on your server. If leaked, contact the administrator to reset it immediately."

msgid "调用接口需要付费吗？"
msgstr "Do API calls cost anything?"

msgid "注册、登录与浏览文档均免费；接入项目开通后即可调用全部对外开放的接口，不按次计费、没有额度门槛（开放接口本就免签名）。"
msgstr "Registration, login and browsing the docs are all free. Once an access project is enabled you can call every public endpoint — no per-call billing and no quota threshold (open endpoints need no signature at all)."

msgid "请立即联系管理员重置密钥，旧密钥会立即失效；重置后所有已接入的调用需改用新密钥。"
msgstr "Contact the administrator immediately to reset the key; the old key becomes invalid at once and all existing callers must switch to the new one."

msgid "开通即无限调用"
msgstr "Unlimited calls once enabled"

msgid "接入项目开通后即可调用全部接口，不按次计费。"
msgstr "Once your access project is enabled you can call every API, with no per-call billing."

msgid "联系管理员在后台创建接入项目，开通后获得专属 APPID 与 APPSECRET。"
msgstr "Ask the administrator to create an access project in the console; you then get a dedicated APPID and APPSECRET."

msgid "开通后调用"
msgstr "Enable, then call"

msgid "调用接口要收费吗？"
msgstr "Do API calls cost anything?"

msgid "小影API 是一个通用 API 聚合服务平台，聚合音乐、视频解析、AI、代理IP、验证码、短信、邮箱、用户中心等 %(n)s 类服务能力，统一签名认证与标准 JSON 响应，注册免费、开通接入项目即可调用全部接口。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI is a general-purpose API aggregation platform covering music, video parsing, AI, proxy IP, CAPTCHA, SMS, email, user center and other service categories (%(n)s in total), with unified signature authentication and standard JSON responses. Registration is free, and an enabled access project can call every API."

msgid "接入项目开通后即可调用全部对外开放的接口，不按次计费，统一 <code class=\"font-mono text-xs\">{ code, msg, data }</code> 响应。"
msgstr "Once your access project is enabled you can call every public API, with no per-call billing and a unified <code class=\"font-mono text-xs\">{ code, msg, data }</code> response."

msgid "接入项目统一由管理员在后台创建，注册账号后请联系管理员开通。开通时会一次性展示 APPID / APPSECRET，请立即保存。APPSECRET 必须保存在你的服务端，严禁写入前端代码或提交到仓库。"
msgstr "Access projects are created by the administrator in the console only — contact the administrator after registering. The APPID / APPSECRET are shown once when the project is enabled, so save them immediately. The APPSECRET must stay on your server and must never appear in frontend code or a repository."

msgid "注册、登录与浏览文档均免费。接入项目开通后即可调用全部对外开放的接口，<strong>不按次计费、没有额度门槛</strong>（开放接口本就免签名）。"
msgstr "Registration, login and browsing the docs are all free. Once your access project is enabled you can call every public API, <strong>with no per-call billing and no quota threshold</strong> (open endpoints need no signature at all)."

msgid "充值中心,账户余额,在线支付"
msgstr "Top-up center, account balance, online payment"

msgid "小影API 充值中心：为账户余额充值（支付宝 / 微信扫码支付）。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI top-up center: add funds to your account balance (Alipay / WeChat QR payment)."

msgid "为账户余额充值（元），可随时查看充值与退款记录。"
msgstr "Add funds to your account balance (CNY), and review top-up and refund records anytime."

# ===== 支付文档：发货口径改为「给指定用户的账户余额加钱」后的新词条 =====

msgid "**支付结果只认异步回调与主动查单，页面跳转不算**：用户付款完成后，平台会异步通知本站，本站校验签名与金额后推进订单（把本次金额加到下单时指定的 `user_id` 的账户余额上）；通知偶有丢失，因此调用方可在支付后轮询 `query` 接口兜底，两边都能触发且**只会发货一次**。"
msgstr "**A payment result is only recognized from the async notification and active order queries — a page redirect does not count**: after the user pays, the platform notifies this site asynchronously; we verify the signature and amount before advancing the order (crediting the amount to the account balance of the `user_id` given at order creation). Notifications are occasionally lost, so callers may poll `query` as a fallback — either path triggers it, and **delivery happens only once**."

msgid "创建一笔支付订单并指定收款用户（`user_id`），返回支付参数（二维码内容或收银台跳转地址）与商户订单号。"
msgstr "Create a payment order with a designated payee (`user_id`), returning the payment parameters (QR-code content or cashier redirect URL) and the merchant order number."

msgid "**只发货一次**：同一订单重复回调 / 回调与查单同时命中时，本站用行锁 + 状态判断保证发货只发生一次。"
msgstr "**Delivered only once**: when the same order is notified repeatedly, or a notification and a query hit at the same time, this site uses row locks plus status checks to guarantee delivery happens exactly once."

msgid "收款用户ID"
msgstr "Payee user ID"

msgid "必填。本站注册用户的 ID（UUID），支付成功后**按订单金额给他的账户余额加钱**（元）"
msgstr "Required. The ID (UUID) of a registered user on this site; on successful payment the order amount is **added to that user's account balance** (CNY)."

msgid "查到平台已支付且本站订单还没推进时，本接口会**当场补发货**（给下单时指定的 `user_id` 的账户余额加钱），因此「回调没收到」也能靠轮询查单兜底。"
msgstr "When the platform shows the order as paid but the local order has not advanced yet, this endpoint **delivers immediately** (crediting the account balance of the `user_id` given at order creation), so a missed notification can still be recovered by polling."

msgid "⚠️ **退款会从收款用户的账户余额里扣回**：若这笔钱已被花掉，余额会被扣成负数（记为欠款），需人工跟进。"
msgstr "⚠️ **A refund debits the payee's account balance**: if the money has already been spent, the balance goes negative (recorded as a debt) and needs manual follow-up."


