# ===== 知乎服务：官网首页服务卡片 + 文档中心正文（声明式数据的 localize，2026-10-03） =====

msgid "知乎"
msgstr "Zhihu"

msgid "知乎热榜与内容检索：热榜按排名返回热点问题（标题 / 直达链接 / 摘要 / 热度 / 回答数）；综合搜索按关键词返回结果（每条自带完整正文与图片）；问题 / 专栏文章详情返回正文与图片、评论、相关问题与「大家都在搜」；登录凭据可用平台统一托管的账号（后台维护），也可由调用方自带 Cookie。"
msgstr "Zhihu hot list and content search: the hot list returns trending questions by rank (title / direct link / excerpt / heat / answer count); the comprehensive search returns results by keyword (each result carries the full body and images); the question / column-article detail returns the body with images, comments, related questions and \"others are searching\"; login credentials can be a platform-hosted account (maintained in the console) or the caller's own cookie."

msgid "知乎热榜"
msgstr "Zhihu hot list"

msgid "热点聚合"
msgstr "Trending aggregation"

msgid "知乎热榜与内容检索：热榜按排名返回当前热点问题；综合搜索按关键词返回结果（每条自带完整正文与图片）；问题 / 专栏文章详情返回正文与图片、评论、相关问题与「大家都在搜」。"
msgstr "Zhihu hot list and content search: the hot list returns current trending questions by rank; the comprehensive search returns results by keyword (each result carries the full body and images); the question / column-article detail returns the body with images, comments, related questions and \"others are searching\"."

msgid "知乎热榜API,知乎热榜接口,知乎热点,知乎榜单数据,知乎搜索API,知乎问题详情,知乎回答评论,知乎专栏文章"
msgstr "zhihu hot list api,zhihu trending api,zhihu hot topics,zhihu ranking data,zhihu search api,zhihu question detail,zhihu answers comments,zhihu column article"

msgid "知乎热榜接口，返回当前知乎热榜的排名、标题、直达链接、摘要、热度与回答数，适合做热点聚合、选题参考与内容看板。"
msgstr "The Zhihu hot-list API returns the current rank, title, direct link, excerpt, heat and answer count for each trending item — handy for trending aggregation, topic research and content dashboards."

msgid "**综合搜索** `/api/zhihu/search`：按关键词搜索知乎内容，**每条结果直接带完整正文与图片**（不是摘要）、作者、赞同数与评论数，并附「大家都在搜」；用 `offset` 翻页。"
msgstr "**Comprehensive search** `/api/zhihu/search`: search Zhihu content by keyword; **each result comes with the full body and images** (not an excerpt), plus author, upvotes and comment count, along with \"others are searching\"; use `offset` to page through results."

msgid "**登录凭据两种用法**：一是在请求里带上 `cookie`（你自己的知乎登录 Cookie，仅本次生效、我们不存储）；不带则回落到**平台统一托管**的账号 —— 平台在后台「账号管理」维护知乎账号与登录 Cookie，接口自动取一份可用凭据去访问。在文档页右侧栏「本机凭据」粘贴并「保存到本机浏览器」，在线调试会自动带上。若平台托管的凭据失效，接口会明确提示需要重新登录，并把该账号标记为「已过期」。"
msgstr "**Two ways to supply the login credential**: pass `cookie` in the request (your own Zhihu login cookie — used for this call only, never stored by us); omit it and the endpoint falls back to the **platform-hosted** account — the platform keeps Zhihu accounts and login cookies under \"Accounts\" in the console and automatically picks an available credential. Paste it into the \"Local credentials\" card in the right sidebar of the docs page and click \"Save to this browser\" so the debugger sends it automatically. If the platform-hosted credential expires, the endpoint explicitly reports that a fresh login is required and marks that account as \"Expired\"."

msgid "`/api/zhihu/check` 用于校验一份知乎凭据是否仍然有效：带上 `cookie` 就校验你自己那份（完全不碰平台账号），不带则校验平台托管的账号并把结果回写到账号状态。"
msgstr "`/api/zhihu/check` verifies whether a Zhihu credential is still valid: pass `cookie` to check your own (the platform account is never touched), or omit it to check the platform-hosted account and write the result back to its status."

msgid "知乎（zhihu.com）"
msgstr "Zhihu (zhihu.com)"

msgid "数据来自知乎官方 web 接口；调用方可自带登录 Cookie，不传则用平台托管的账号。"
msgstr "Data comes from Zhihu's official web endpoints; callers may supply their own login cookie, otherwise the platform-hosted account is used."

msgid "知乎登录 Cookie"
msgstr "Zhihu login Cookie"

msgid "在右侧栏「本机凭据」粘贴并保存到本机"
msgstr "Paste it into the \"Local credentials\" card in the right sidebar and save it to this machine"

msgid "可选。填了就用你这份 Cookie 访问（仅本次生效、不落库、不会上传给我们）；留空则用平台统一托管的账号。"
msgstr "Optional. If provided, your cookie is used for this call only — never stored and never uploaded to us; if omitted, the platform-hosted account is used."

msgid "可选。填了就只校验你这份（不碰平台账号、不回写任何状态）；留空则校验平台托管的账号并把结果回写其状态。"
msgstr "Optional. If provided, only your cookie is checked (the platform account is neither read nor written); if omitted, the platform-hosted account is checked and its status is updated."

msgid "也接受 GET（此时参数走 query 串）；因知乎 Cookie 较长，推荐用 POST 放表单体。"
msgstr "GET is also accepted (parameters go in the query string); because a Zhihu cookie is long, POST with the cookie in the form body is recommended."

msgid "热榜"
msgstr "Hot list"

msgid "获取知乎热榜（默认 50 条，最多 50 条）。"
msgstr "Get the Zhihu hot list (50 items by default, 50 max)."

msgid "返回条数"
msgstr "Number of items"

msgid "如 50"
msgstr "e.g. 50"

msgid "可选，1~50，默认 50。超出范围返回参数值非法。"
msgstr "Optional, 1–50, default 50. Out-of-range values return an invalid-parameter error."

msgid "热度为知乎原始文案（如「1370 万热度」），未做数值化处理，避免口径误读。"
msgstr "Heat is kept as Zhihu's original wording (e.g. \"13.7M heat\") without numeric conversion, to avoid misreading the metric."

msgid "`url` 是可在浏览器直接打开的网页地址；`question_id` 为知乎问题 ID。"
msgstr "`url` is a web address you can open directly in a browser; `question_id` is the Zhihu question ID."

msgid "本次返回的条数"
msgstr "Number of items returned"

msgid "排名，从 1 开始"
msgstr "Rank, starting from 1"

msgid "网页地址（可直接打开）"
msgstr "Web address (openable directly)"

msgid "摘要（可能为空）"
msgstr "Excerpt (may be empty)"

msgid "热度文案，如「1370 万热度」"
msgstr "Heat text, e.g. \"13.7M heat\""

msgid "回答数（可能为 0）"
msgstr "Answer count (may be 0)"

msgid "知乎问题 ID"
msgstr "Zhihu question ID"

msgid "封面图地址（可能为空）"
msgstr "Cover image URL (may be empty)"

msgid "校验登录凭据"
msgstr "Verify login credentials"

msgid "校验知乎登录凭据是否有效（自带 cookie 校验你自己那份，否则校验平台托管的账号）。"
msgstr "Verify whether a Zhihu login credential is valid (pass `cookie` to check your own, otherwise the platform-hosted account is checked)."

msgid "凭据无效**不算接口调用失败**：仍返回成功码，把 `valid=false` 与原因放在 data 里，由调用方自行决定是否提示用户重新登录。"
msgstr "An invalid credential **does not count as an API failure**: the endpoint still returns a success code, with `valid=false` and the reason in `data`, letting the caller decide whether to prompt the user to sign in again."

msgid "校验平台托管的账号时会更新其「凭据状态」与「最近校验结果」，在后台「账号管理」页可直接看到；自带 Cookie 校验不涉及平台账号。"
msgstr "Checking the platform-hosted account updates its \"credential status\" and \"last check result\", visible directly on the console's \"Accounts\" page; checking your own cookie does not touch the platform account."

msgid "凭据是否有效"
msgstr "Whether the credential is valid"

msgid "被校验的账号标识（自带 Cookie 校验时为空）"
msgstr "The account identifier that was checked (empty when checking your own cookie)"

msgid "校验说明（有效时含登录用户名）"
msgstr "Check message (includes the signed-in username when valid)"


# ===== 知乎服务：问题详情（/api/zhihu/question，2026-10-03） =====

msgid "**问题详情** `/api/zhihu/question`：传问题 ID（或问题网页地址）即可拿到问题正文与其中的图片、回答列表（含正文图片与各自的热门评论）、问题本身的评论、相关问题与「大家都在搜」；回答条数与评论条数都可用参数调整。"
msgstr "**Question detail** `/api/zhihu/question`: pass a question ID (or the question page URL) to get the question body with its images, the answer list (with images and each answer's top comments), the question's own comments, related questions and \"others are searching\"; the number of answers and comments can be tuned with parameters."

msgid "**专栏文章详情** `/api/zhihu/article`：传文章 ID（或文章网页地址）即可拿到**完整正文**与其中的图片、评论与「大家都在搜」。文章页只有这三个模块 —— 没有「回答列表」和「相关问题」（后者是问题页专有）。"
msgstr "**Column article detail** `/api/zhihu/article`: pass an article ID (or the article page URL) to get the **full article body** with its images, comments and \"others are searching\". An article page has only these three modules — there is no \"answer list\" and no \"related questions\" (those are question-page only)."

msgid "问题详情"
msgstr "Question detail"

msgid "问题详情：问题正文与图片、回答（含图片与评论）、问题评论、相关问题、大家都在搜。"
msgstr "Question detail: the question body with images, answers (with images and comments), question comments, related questions and \"others are searching\"."

msgid "问题 ID 或网页地址"
msgstr "Question ID or page URL"

msgid "回答条数"
msgstr "Number of answers"

msgid "每条回答的评论数"
msgstr "Comments per answer"

msgid "问题评论数"
msgstr "Number of question comments"

msgid "如 2089437755591713926"
msgstr "e.g. 2089437755591713926"

msgid "如 5"
msgstr "e.g. 5"

msgid "如 3"
msgstr "e.g. 3"

msgid "必填。知乎问题 ID（纯数字），也可以直接填问题网页地址（形如 https://www.zhihu.com/question/2089437755591713926）。"
msgstr "Required. The Zhihu question ID (plain digits), or the question page URL (e.g. https://www.zhihu.com/question/2089437755591713926)."

msgid "可选，1~20，默认 5。返回多少条回答。"
msgstr "Optional, 1–20, default 5. How many answers to return."

msgid "可选，0~20，默认 3。每条回答返回多少条热门评论（0 = 不取）。"
msgstr "Optional, 0–20, default 3. How many top comments to return per answer (0 = none)."

msgid "可选，0~20，默认 10。问题本身的评论返回多少条（0 = 不取）。"
msgstr "Optional, 0–20, default 10. How many of the question's own comments to return (0 = none)."

msgid "**图片**：问题正文与回答正文都同时给出 HTML 原文（`detail` / `content`，可直接渲染）与抽好的 `images` 图片地址数组（原图优先、已去重）。"
msgstr "**Images**: both the question body and each answer body come with the raw HTML (`detail` / `content`, ready to render) *and* a pre-extracted `images` array of image URLs (original resolution preferred, de-duplicated)."

msgid "**评论**：问题评论在 `question.comments`，每条回答的评论在该回答的 `comments` 里；每条评论会内联最多 3 条子评论（回复）。"
msgstr "**Comments**: the question's comments are in `question.comments`, and each answer's comments are in that answer's `comments`; every comment inlines up to 3 child comments (replies)."

msgid "`answer_count` / `comment_count` 是**总数**，不等于本次返回的条数 —— 本次条数由 `answer_limit` / `comment_limit` 决定。"
msgstr "`answer_count` / `comment_count` are **totals**, not the number returned in this call — the returned counts are controlled by `answer_limit` / `comment_limit`."

msgid "「相关问题」由知乎动态给出，条数不固定（最多 5 条）；「大家都在搜」固定 10 条，并附带可直接打开的知乎搜索页地址。"
msgstr "\"Related questions\" are supplied dynamically by Zhihu, so the count varies (5 max); \"others are searching\" always returns 10 items, each with a ready-to-open Zhihu search URL."

msgid "问题本体（标题 / 正文 / 话题 / 计数）解析自问题页内嵌数据（知乎该接口带签名校验，无法直取）；解析失败时接口会明确报错。"
msgstr "The question itself (title / body / topics / counters) is parsed from data embedded in the question page (Zhihu's own endpoint is signature-gated and cannot be called directly); if parsing fails, the endpoint reports it explicitly."

msgid "问题 ID"
msgstr "Question ID"

msgid "问题网页地址"
msgstr "Question page URL"

msgid "问题正文 HTML（原样保留）"
msgstr "Question body HTML (kept verbatim)"

msgid "问题正文里的图片地址"
msgstr "Image URLs in the question body"

msgid "正文摘要"
msgstr "Body excerpt"

msgid "话题名"
msgstr "Topic name"

msgid "话题网页地址"
msgstr "Topic page URL"

msgid "回答总数"
msgstr "Total answers"

msgid "关注者数"
msgstr "Followers"

msgid "评论总数"
msgstr "Total comments"

msgid "被浏览数"
msgstr "View count"

msgid "创建时间（Unix 秒）"
msgstr "Created time (Unix seconds)"

msgid "更新时间（Unix 秒）"
msgstr "Updated time (Unix seconds)"

msgid "问题评论（结构见下）"
msgstr "Question comments (shape listed below)"

msgid "评论正文（纯文本）"
msgstr "Comment body (plain text)"

msgid "评论者昵称"
msgstr "Commenter name"

msgid "子评论总数"
msgstr "Total child comments"

msgid "回复的对象（子评论才有）"
msgstr "Reply target (child comments only)"

msgid "内联的子评论（最多 3 条，结构与父评论一致）"
msgstr "Inlined child comments (up to 3, same shape as the parent)"

msgid "回答 ID"
msgstr "Answer ID"

msgid "回答网页地址"
msgstr "Answer page URL"

msgid "回答正文 HTML"
msgstr "Answer body HTML"

msgid "回答正文里的图片地址"
msgstr "Image URLs in the answer body"

msgid "回答摘要"
msgstr "Answer excerpt"

msgid "回答者昵称"
msgstr "Author name"

msgid "回答者主页地址"
msgstr "Author profile URL"

msgid "赞同数"
msgstr "Upvotes"

msgid "该回答的评论总数"
msgstr "Total comments on this answer"

msgid "该回答的评论（结构与 question.comments[] 一致）"
msgstr "This answer's comments (same shape as question.comments[])"

msgid "相关问题标题"
msgstr "Related question title"

msgid "相关问题网页地址"
msgstr "Related question page URL"

msgid "回答数"
msgstr "Answer count"

msgid "搜索词"
msgstr "Search term"

msgid "热度值"
msgstr "Heat value"

msgid "热度文案（如「648 万」）"
msgstr "Heat text (e.g. \"6.48M\")"

msgid "知乎搜索页地址"
msgstr "Zhihu search page URL"


# ===== 知乎服务：专栏文章详情（/api/zhihu/article，2026-10-03） =====

msgid "专栏文章详情"
msgstr "Column article detail"

msgid "知乎专栏文章详情：完整正文与图片、评论、大家都在搜。"
msgstr "Zhihu column article detail: the full article body with images, comments and \"others are searching\"."

msgid "文章 ID 或网页地址"
msgstr "Article ID or page URL"

msgid "如 608180793"
msgstr "e.g. 608180793"

msgid "必填。知乎文章 ID（纯数字），也可以直接填文章网页地址（形如 https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/608180793）。"
msgstr "Required. The Zhihu article ID (plain digits), or the article page URL (e.g. https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/608180793)."

msgid "可选，0~20，默认 10。返回多少条热门评论（0 = 不取）。"
msgstr "Optional, 0–20, default 10. How many top comments to return (0 = none)."

msgid "**正文是全文**：取的是文章页内嵌的完整正文，不是摘要；`content_truncated` 为 `true` 时才表示知乎把超长文章的正文截断了（罕见）。"
msgstr "**The body is the full text**: it is the complete article body embedded in the page, not an excerpt; `content_truncated` is `true` only when Zhihu itself truncated a very long article (rare)."

msgid "**图片**：`content` 是 HTML 原文（可直接渲染），`images` 是抽好的图片地址数组（原图优先、已去重）。"
msgstr "**Images**: `content` is the raw HTML (ready to render) and `images` is a pre-extracted array of image URLs (original resolution preferred, de-duplicated)."

msgid "**文章页只有三个模块**：正文、评论、大家都在搜 —— 没有「回答列表」与「相关问题」（后者是问题页专有）。"
msgstr "**An article page has only three modules**: body, comments and \"others are searching\" — there is no \"answer list\" and no \"related questions\" (those are question-page only)."

msgid "`comment_count` 是评论**总数**，不等于本次返回的条数（本次条数由`comment_limit` 决定）。"
msgstr "`comment_count` is the **total** number of comments, not the number returned in this call (that is controlled by `comment_limit`)."

msgid "文章 ID"
msgstr "Article ID"

msgid "文章网页地址"
msgstr "Article page URL"

msgid "文章正文 HTML（原样保留，可含图片 / 代码块 / 引用）"
msgstr "Article body HTML (kept verbatim; may contain images / code blocks / quotes)"

msgid "正文里的图片地址"
msgstr "Image URLs in the body"

msgid "「喜欢」数"
msgstr "\"Like\" count"

msgid "正文是否被知乎截断（true 表示拿到的不是全文）"
msgstr "Whether Zhihu truncated the body (true means this is not the full text)"

msgid "发布时间（Unix 秒）"
msgstr "Published time (Unix seconds)"

msgid "评论（结构与 question.comments[] 一致）"
msgstr "Comments (same shape as question.comments[])"


# ===== 知乎服务：综合搜索（/api/zhihu/search，2026-10-03） =====

msgid "综合搜索"
msgstr "Comprehensive search"

msgid "知乎综合搜索：结果列表（每条自带完整正文与图片）+「大家都在搜」。"
msgstr "Zhihu comprehensive search: a result list (each result carries the full body and images) plus \"others are searching\"."

msgid "如 学生妹"
msgstr "e.g. 学生妹"

msgid "必填。要搜索的关键词。"
msgstr "Required. The keyword to search for."

msgid "如 20"
msgstr "e.g. 20"

msgid "可选，1~20，默认 20（知乎单页上限就是 20 条）。"
msgstr "Optional, 1–20, default 20 (a single Zhihu page returns at most 20 items)."

msgid "翻页偏移"
msgstr "Page offset"

msgid "如 0"
msgstr "e.g. 0"

msgid "可选，0~1000，默认 0。翻页时把上一次返回的 `next_offset` 填进来。"
msgstr "Optional, 0–1000, default 0. To page through results, pass the `next_offset` returned by the previous call."

msgid "**每条结果直接带完整正文**（`content`，实测最长上万字，不是摘要），所以「阅读全文」不需要再逐条回源。"
msgstr "**Each result carries the full body directly** (`content`, up to tens of thousands of characters in practice, not an excerpt), so \"read the full text\" needs no per-item round trip."

msgid "结果类型有 `answer`（回答）/ `article`（专栏文章）/ `zvideo`（视频）；视频没有正文，`content` 为空字符串。回答会带 `question`（所属问题），文章与视频为 `null`。"
msgstr "Result types are `answer`, `article` and `zvideo`; a video has no body, so `content` is an empty string. An answer includes `question` (the question it belongs to); for articles and videos it is `null`."

msgid "**评论只给数量**（`comment_count`，即页面上的「N 条评论」），不逐条回源 —— 否则一次搜索要打几十个请求；要评论内容请用问题详情 / 专栏文章详情接口。"
msgstr "**Comments are given as a count only** (`comment_count`, i.e. the \"N comments\" shown on the page) rather than fetched item by item — otherwise a single search would fire dozens of requests; for comment content use the question detail / column-article detail endpoints."

msgid "标题与摘要里的 `<em>` 高亮标签已去掉、HTML 实体已还原，是可直接展示的纯文本。"
msgstr "The `<em>` highlight tags in titles and excerpts have been stripped and HTML entities restored, so they are plain text ready for display."

msgid "**翻页**：把返回的 `next_offset` 作为下一次的 `offset`；`is_end` 为 `true` 时 `next_offset` 为 `null`，表示没有下一页了。"
msgstr "**Paging**: pass the returned `next_offset` as the next call's `offset`; when `is_end` is `true`, `next_offset` is `null`, meaning there is no next page."

msgid "是否已到最后一页"
msgstr "Whether the last page has been reached"

msgid "下一页的 offset（已是最后一页时为 null）"
msgstr "Offset of the next page (null on the last page)"

msgid "本页内的序号，从 1 开始"
msgstr "Index within this page, starting from 1"

msgid "结果类型：answer / article / zvideo"
msgstr "Result type: answer / article / zvideo"

msgid "内容 ID"
msgstr "Content ID"

msgid "标题（已去高亮标签）"
msgstr "Title (highlight tags removed)"

msgid "完整正文 HTML（视频为空）"
msgstr "Full body HTML (empty for videos)"

msgid "摘要（已去高亮标签）"
msgstr "Excerpt (highlight tags removed)"

msgid "作者主页地址"
msgstr "Author profile URL"

msgid "回答所属问题的标题（非回答时为空）"
msgstr "Title of the question the answer belongs to (empty for non-answers)"


# ===== 微博服务：官网首页服务卡片 + 文档中心正文（声明式数据的 localize，2026-10-03） =====

msgid "微博内容聚合：按频道（分类）取内容 —— 正文、图片、视频直链、被转发的原微博、作者与转发 / 评论 / 点赞数，长文自动展开全文；频道分类（我的频道 / 频道推荐）单独一个接口。登录凭据可用平台统一托管的账号（后台维护），也可由调用方自带 Cookie。"
msgstr "Weibo content aggregation: fetch content by channel (category) — text, images, direct video links, the reposted original post, author and repost / comment / like counts, with long posts auto-expanded to full text; the channel list (my channels / recommended channels) has its own endpoint. Login credentials can be a platform-hosted account (maintained in the console) or the caller's own cookie."

msgid "微博热门"
msgstr "Weibo hot"

msgid "内容聚合"
msgstr "Content aggregation"

msgid "微博内容聚合：按频道（分类）取内容 —— 正文、图片、视频直链、转发原微博、作者与互动数，长文自动展开全文；频道分类（我的频道 / 频道推荐）单独给一个接口。"
msgstr "Weibo content aggregation: fetch content by channel (category) — text, images, direct video links, the reposted original post, author and interaction counts, with long posts auto-expanded to full text; the channel list (my channels / recommended channels) comes from its own endpoint."

msgid "微博API,微博热门接口,微博频道分类,微博内容采集,微博长文,微博视频直链"
msgstr "weibo api,weibo hot api,weibo channel list,weibo content scraping,weibo long post,weibo video direct link"

msgid "微博内容聚合接口：先调 `/api/weibo/channels` 拿到**频道分类**，再用 `/api/weibo/feed` 按频道取内容 —— 每条微博给出正文、图片、视频直链、被转发的原微博、作者与转发 / 评论 / 点赞数。"
msgstr "The Weibo content aggregation API: first call `/api/weibo/channels` to get the **channel list**, then `/api/weibo/feed` to fetch content by channel — each post comes with its text, images, direct video links, the reposted original post, author and repost / comment / like counts."

msgid "**频道（分类）**：微博热门页 `https://weibo.com/hot/weibo/102803` 里的 `102803` 就是频道 ID（= 热门）。分类接口返回「我的频道」（当前登录账号的频道）与「频道推荐」两组，每组都给出频道名、ID 与 `containerid` —— 取内容时两个 ID 都要带上（微博要求它们分别传，且取值不同）。"
msgstr "**Channels (categories)**: in the Weibo hot page `https://weibo.com/hot/weibo/102803`, `102803` is the channel ID (= Hot). The channel endpoint returns two groups — \"My channels\" (the signed-in account's channels) and \"Recommended channels\" — each giving the channel name, ID and `containerid`; both IDs must be passed when fetching content (Weibo requires them separately, and their values differ)."

msgid "**长文自动展开**：正文被截断的长微博会自动回源取全文，`content` 就是完整正文，不需要调用方再点一次「展开全文」。"
msgstr "**Long posts are auto-expanded**: when a long post's text is truncated, the service fetches the full text upstream, so `content` is already the complete text and the caller does not need to expand it again."

msgid "**登录凭据两种用法**：一是在请求里带上 `cookie`（你自己的微博登录 Cookie，仅本次生效、我们不存储）；不带则回落到**平台统一托管**的账号 —— 平台在后台「账号管理」维护微博账号与登录 Cookie，接口自动取一份可用凭据去访问。在文档页右侧栏「本机凭据」粘贴并「保存到本机浏览器」，在线调试会自动带上。若平台托管的凭据失效，接口会明确提示需要重新登录，并把该账号标记为「已过期」。"
msgstr "**Two ways to supply the login credential**: pass `cookie` in the request (your own Weibo login cookie — used for this call only, never stored by us); omit it and the endpoint falls back to the **platform-hosted** account — the platform keeps Weibo accounts and login cookies under \"Accounts\" in the console and automatically picks an available credential. Paste it into the \"Local credentials\" card in the right sidebar of the docs page and click \"Save to this browser\" so the debugger sends it automatically. If the platform-hosted credential expires, the endpoint explicitly reports that a fresh login is required and marks that account as \"Expired\"."

msgid "`/api/weibo/check` 用于校验一份微博凭据是否仍然有效：带上 `cookie` 就校验你自己那份（完全不碰平台账号），不带则校验平台托管的账号并把结果回写到账号状态。"
msgstr "`/api/weibo/check` verifies whether a Weibo credential is still valid: pass `cookie` to check your own (the platform account is never touched), or omit it to check the platform-hosted account and write the result back to its status."

msgid "微博（weibo.com）"
msgstr "Weibo (weibo.com)"

msgid "数据来自微博官方 web 接口；调用方可自带登录 Cookie，不传则用平台托管的账号。"
msgstr "Data comes from Weibo's official web endpoints; callers may supply their own login cookie, otherwise the platform-hosted account is used."

msgid "微博登录 Cookie"
msgstr "Weibo login Cookie"

msgid "频道分类"
msgstr "Channel list"

msgid "微博频道分类：「我的频道」与「频道推荐」两组，含频道名 / ID / containerid。"
msgstr "Weibo channels: the \"My channels\" and \"Recommended channels\" groups, with name / ID / containerid."

msgid "**频道 ID 就是网页里的数字**：`https://weibo.com/hot/weibo/102803` 的 `102803` 即频道 ID（热门）；换别的频道就是换这个数字。"
msgstr "**The channel ID is the number in the page URL**: `102803` in `https://weibo.com/hot/weibo/102803` is the channel ID (Hot); switching channels means switching this number."

msgid "**两组都返回**，用 `section` 区分：「我的频道」随登录账号而变，「频道推荐」是微博推荐的通用频道。"
msgstr "**Both groups are returned**, distinguished by `section`: \"My channels\" varies per signed-in account, while \"Recommended channels\" are Weibo's generic suggestions."

msgid "**`containerid` 要一起带上**：取内容时微博要求 `group_id` 传频道 ID、`containerid` 传它自己的值，两者对多数频道**并不相同**（如 明星 `1028034288` / `102803_ctg1_4288_-_ctg1_4288`）。"
msgstr "**Pass `containerid` along**: when fetching content, Weibo requires `group_id` to be the channel ID and `containerid` to be its own value, and the two **differ** for most channels (e.g. Celebrity `1028034288` / `102803_ctg1_4288_-_ctg1_4288`)."

msgid "该接口本身不校验登录态（不带 Cookie 也能返回游客默认频道），但「我的频道」会随账号不同而变化。"
msgstr "This endpoint does not require a login (without a cookie it still returns a guest's default channels), but \"My channels\" varies per account."

msgid "也接受 GET（此时参数走 query 串）；因微博 Cookie 较长，推荐用 POST 放表单体。"
msgstr "GET is also accepted (parameters go in the query string); because a Weibo cookie is long, POST with the cookie in the form body is recommended."

msgid "两组加起来的频道总数"
msgstr "Total channels across both groups"

msgid "分组名：我的频道 / 频道推荐"
msgstr "Group name: My channels / Recommended channels"

msgid "该分组下的频道数"
msgstr "Number of channels in this group"

msgid "频道 ID（= 网页 /hot/weibo/{id} 里的数字）"
msgstr "Channel ID (= the number in /hot/weibo/{id})"

msgid "频道名"
msgstr "Channel name"

msgid "频道 containerid（取内容时与 id 一起传）"
msgstr "Channel containerid (pass together with id when fetching content)"

msgid "频道网页地址"
msgstr "Channel page URL"

msgid "按频道取内容"
msgstr "Fetch content by channel"

msgid "按频道取内容：正文、图片、视频直链、转发原微博、作者与互动数。"
msgstr "Fetch content by channel: text, images, direct video links, the reposted original post, author and interaction counts."

msgid "频道 ID"
msgstr "Channel ID"

msgid "如 102803"
msgstr "e.g. 102803"

msgid "可选，默认 102803（热门）。取值 = `/api/weibo/channels` 返回的频道 ID。"
msgstr "Optional, default 102803 (Hot). Value = the channel ID returned by `/api/weibo/channels`."

msgid "频道 containerid"
msgstr "Channel containerid"

msgid "留空自动解析"
msgstr "Leave empty to auto-resolve"

msgid "可选。取值 = `/api/weibo/channels` 返回的 containerid；留空时服务端会按 channel 自动解析（多一次请求）。"
msgstr "Optional. Value = the containerid returned by `/api/weibo/channels`; when empty the server resolves it from `channel` (one extra request)."

msgid "可选，1~50，默认 20。"
msgstr "Optional, 1–50, default 20."

msgid "翻页游标"
msgstr "Page cursor"

msgid "可选，默认 0。翻页时把上一次返回的 `next_since_id` 填进来。"
msgstr "Optional, default 0. To page through results, pass the `next_since_id` returned by the previous call."

msgid "**长文自动展开**：`is_long_text` 为 `true` 的长微博，服务端会回源取全文（取到的更长才替换），`content` 即完整正文（不是摘要、无需再点「展开全文」）。"
msgstr "**Long posts are auto-expanded**: for long posts where `is_long_text` is `true`, the server fetches the full text and replaces the body when it is longer, so `content` is the complete text (not an excerpt, no need to expand)."

msgid "**图片**：`content_html` 是 HTML 原文（可直接渲染），`images` 是抽好的图片地址数组（大图优先、已去重）。"
msgstr "**Images**: `content_html` is the raw HTML (ready to render) and `images` is a pre-extracted array of image URLs (large size preferred, de-duplicated)."

msgid "**视频**：`video.url` 是 mp4 直链（高清优先，**已统一升级为 https**），另有封面 / 标题 / 时长 / 视频页地址；没有视频时 `video` 为 `null`。"
msgstr "**Video**: `video.url` is a direct mp4 link (HD preferred, **normalized to https**), plus cover / title / duration / video page URL; `video` is `null` when there is no video."

msgid "**视频直链有防盗链**：`video.url` 是微博 CDN 的 mp4 直链，请求时必须带 `Referer: https://weibo.com/` 才能取到（无 Referer 或第三方域名一律返回 403），且地址带 `Expires` 签名、**限时有效**。要在网页里直接播放，请用 `video.stream_url`（本站代理，见「视频代理播放」端点）；`video.url` 更适合你服务端下载后再自行处理。"
msgstr "**The video direct link is referer-protected**: `video.url` points to Weibo's mp4 CDN and can only be fetched with a `Referer: https://weibo.com/` header (no referer, or any third-party domain, returns 403). The URL is signed with `Expires` and is **time-limited**. To play it directly in a web page, use `video.stream_url` (our proxy — see the \"Video proxy playback\" endpoint); `video.url` is better suited to server-side downloading."

msgid "**转发**：被转发的原微博在 `retweeted`（裁剪版，不再向下展开它的转发与长文）；没有转发时为 `null`。"
msgstr "**Repost**: the reposted original post is in `retweeted` (a trimmed version — its own repost and long text are not expanded); it is `null` when there is no repost."

msgid "**翻页**：把返回的 `next_since_id` 作为下一次的 `since_id`；`next_since_id` 为 `null`（`has_more` 为 `false`）表示上游没有给出下一页游标。"
msgstr "**Paging**: pass the returned `next_since_id` as the next call's `since_id`; a `null` `next_since_id` (`has_more` is `false`) means the upstream provided no cursor for the next page."

msgid "`containerid` 留空时服务端会先查一次频道分类来解析它；想省这次请求，就把 `/api/weibo/channels` 返回的 `containerid` 一起带上。"
msgstr "When `containerid` is empty the server first queries the channel list to resolve it; to save that request, pass the `containerid` returned by `/api/weibo/channels`."

msgid "频道 ID（原样回传）"
msgstr "Channel ID (echoed back)"

msgid "频道 containerid（原样回传）"
msgstr "Channel containerid (echoed back)"

msgid "上游给出的该频道总条数（翻页参考）"
msgstr "Total items for this channel as reported upstream (for paging reference)"

msgid "本次请求使用的翻页游标"
msgstr "Page cursor used for this request"

msgid "下一页游标（null 表示没有下一页）"
msgstr "Cursor for the next page (null means no next page)"

msgid "是否还有下一页"
msgstr "Whether there is a next page"

msgid "微博 ID"
msgstr "Post ID"

msgid "微博 mid"
msgstr "Post mid"

msgid "微博短 ID（网页地址用它拼）"
msgstr "Post short ID (used to build the page URL)"

msgid "微博网页地址（可直接打开）"
msgstr "Post page URL (openable directly)"

msgid "正文纯文本（长文已展开为全文）"
msgstr "Post text as plain text (long posts expanded to full text)"

msgid "正文 HTML 原文（含 @ / 话题 / 链接标签）"
msgstr "Raw post HTML (with @ / topic / link tags)"

msgid "是否为长文"
msgstr "Whether this is a long post"

msgid "图片地址（大图优先）"
msgstr "Image URLs (large size preferred)"

msgid "视频信息（无视频为 null）"
msgstr "Video info (null when there is no video)"

msgid "微博 CDN 的 mp4 直链（https、高清优先；有 Referer 防盗链）"
msgstr "Weibo CDN mp4 direct link (https, HD preferred; referer-protected)"

msgid "本站代理播放地址（<video> 直接可用、长期有效）"
msgstr "Our proxy playback URL (ready for a <video> tag, long-lived)"

msgid "视频封面地址"
msgstr "Video cover URL"

msgid "视频标题"
msgstr "Video title"

msgid "视频时长（秒）"
msgstr "Video duration (seconds)"

msgid "视频页地址"
msgstr "Video page URL"

msgid "被转发的原微博（无转发为 null）"
msgstr "The reposted original post (null when there is none)"

msgid "原微博正文"
msgstr "Original post text"

msgid "原作者昵称"
msgstr "Original author name"

msgid "原微博网页地址"
msgstr "Original post page URL"

msgid "作者 ID"
msgstr "Author ID"

msgid "作者头像地址"
msgstr "Author avatar URL"

msgid "作者是否认证"
msgstr "Whether the author is verified"

msgid "转发数"
msgstr "Reposts"

msgid "来源（如 iPhone客户端）"
msgstr "Source (e.g. iPhone client)"

msgid "地区（可能为空）"
msgstr "Region (may be empty)"

msgid "是否广告"
msgstr "Whether this is an ad"

msgid "校验微博登录凭据是否有效（自带 cookie 校验你自己那份，否则校验平台托管的账号）。"
msgstr "Verify whether a Weibo login credential is valid (pass `cookie` to check your own, otherwise the platform-hosted account is checked)."

msgid "微博接口在未登录时**仍返回 HTTP 200**（body 是 `ok: -100` 的登录跳转），本接口按此判定凭据是否有效，因此比只看状态码可靠。"
msgstr "Weibo endpoints **still return HTTP 200 when not signed in** (the body is an `ok: -100` login redirect); this endpoint judges validity from that, which is more reliable than the status code alone."

msgid "校验说明"
msgstr "Check message"

msgid "视频代理播放"
msgstr "Video proxy playback"

msgid "微博视频代理播放：本站取流后转发，普通 <video> 标签直接播放。"
msgstr "Weibo video proxy playback: the stream is fetched upstream and relayed, so a plain <video> tag can play it."

msgid "由 feed 接口的 video.stream_url 携带"
msgstr "Carried by video.stream_url from the feed endpoint"

msgid "必填：由 `/api/weibo/feed` 下发的时效令牌，无需项目签名（浏览器加不了签名）。"
msgstr "Required: the time-limited token issued by `/api/weibo/feed`; no project signature needed (browsers cannot sign)."

msgid "**为什么需要代理**：微博视频 CDN 有 Referer 防盗链，只认微博系域名 —— 第三方页面的 `<video>` 带的是自己的域名，一律 403；直链又是 `http://`，https 页面还会被浏览器按混合内容直接拦掉。本端点带 `Referer` 取流后原样转发。"
msgstr "**Why a proxy is needed**: Weibo's video CDN enforces a referer check and only accepts Weibo domains — a third-party page's `<video>` sends its own domain and always gets 403; the direct link is also `http://`, which an https page blocks as mixed content. This endpoint fetches the stream with a `Referer` header and relays it as-is."

msgid "地址由 `/api/weibo/feed` 的 `video.stream_url` 给出、**长期有效**：令牌里只有微博 id，播放时按 id 现场解析新鲜直链（微博直链带 `Expires` 会过期）。"
msgstr "The URL comes from `video.stream_url` of `/api/weibo/feed` and is **long-lived**: the token only carries the Weibo id, and the fresh direct link is resolved by id at playback time (Weibo's direct links carry `Expires` and do expire)."

msgid "**本端点不带项目签名**：浏览器加不了签名，且拖动进度条产生的多次 Range 请求会撞上「nonce 一次性」的重放拦截，故鉴权由 URL 里的时效令牌承担。"
msgstr "**This endpoint does not use the project signature**: browsers cannot sign, and the multiple Range requests produced by seeking would hit the one-time-nonce replay block, so authentication is carried by the time-limited token in the URL."

msgid "支持 HTTP Range（200 整段 / 206 分片）：可拖动进度条、可断点续传。"
msgstr "HTTP Range is supported (200 for the whole file / 206 for a chunk): seeking and resuming both work."

msgid "令牌无效或过期返回 403（重新调用 feed 拿新地址即可）；上游取流失败走统一错误码（40001 / 50002）。"
msgstr "An invalid or expired token returns 403 (just call feed again for a fresh URL); upstream fetch failures use the standard codes (40001 / 50002)."

msgid "成功返回视频二进制流（video/mp4，支持 Range），**不是统一 JSON 信封**；令牌无效或过期返回 403。"
msgstr "On success it returns a video binary stream (video/mp4, Range supported) — **not** the standard JSON envelope; an invalid or expired token returns 403."


