msgstr "Message Push"

msgid "把消息推送到手机的通知服务：当前接入 Server酱（sct.ftqq.com）一条线路，适合服务器告警、任务完成、定时任务结果等场景；SendKey 由后台「账号管理」统一托管。"
msgstr "A notification service that pushes messages to your phone. It currently has one channel: ServerChan (sct.ftqq.com), ideal for server alerts, task completion and scheduled-job results; the SendKey is managed centrally in the console's Account Management."

msgid "微信推送"
msgstr "WeChat push"

msgid "通知"
msgstr "Notification"

msgid "Server酱"
msgstr "ServerChan"

# --- 文档中心（website/docs/push.py） ---
msgid "消息推送服务"
msgstr "Message Push Service"

msgid "把消息推送到手机的通知服务。当前接入 Server酱 1 条线路，后续可继续扩展更多推送平台/线路。"
msgstr "A notification service that pushes messages to your phone. One channel (ServerChan) is available now; more push platforms/channels can be added later."

msgid "消息推送API,微信推送接口,Server酱API,ServerChan,服务器告警推送,通知接口"
msgstr "message push API,WeChat push API,ServerChan API,ServerChan,server alert push,notification API"

msgid "消息推送服务把「服务器 / 脚本 / 设备上发生的事」发送到手机，适合告警、任务完成通知、定时任务结果汇总等场景。当前接入 Server酱（sct.ftqq.com）一条线路：调用本服务的发送接口，消息经由 Server酱 推送到你手机。"
msgstr "The message push service sends what happens on your server / scripts / devices to your phone — ideal for alerts, task-completion notices and scheduled-job summaries. One channel is available now: ServerChan (sct.ftqq.com). Call this service's send endpoint and the message is delivered to your phone through ServerChan."

msgid "**消息实际推送到哪个通道**（微信服务号、企业微信应用消息、企业微信/钉钉/飞书群机器人、Bark、PushDeer 或自定义 Webhook）由 Server酱 后台的通道配置决定 —— 换通道不用改调用代码。"
msgstr "**Which channel the message actually reaches** (WeChat service account, WeCom app message, WeCom/DingTalk/Feishu group bot, Bark, PushDeer or a custom webhook) is decided by the channel configuration in the ServerChan console — switching channels requires no code change."

msgid "**SendKey 由服务端托管**：在超管控制台「账号管理」里新增一个平台为「Server酱」的账号，把 SendKey 填进「登录凭据」字段即可（凭据加密落库、页面不回显）。调用方无需、也不应传递 SendKey。"
msgstr "**The SendKey is hosted server-side**: add an account whose platform is \"ServerChan\" in the superadmin console's Account Management, and put the SendKey in the credential field (stored encrypted, never shown on pages). Callers neither need to nor should pass a SendKey."

msgid "本服务接口需项目签名调用；每次推送都会在控制台「推送日志」留痕（成功与失败都记）。"
msgstr "These endpoints require a project signature; every push leaves a record in the console's Push Logs (both successes and failures)."

msgid "Server酱（sct.ftqq.com）微信推送"
msgstr "ServerChan (sct.ftqq.com) WeChat push"

msgid "通过 Server酱 的 SendKey 推送消息；SendKey 由服务端托管（控制台「账号管理」）。需项目签名调用。"
msgstr "Push messages via a ServerChan SendKey; the SendKey is hosted server-side (console's Account Management). Project signature required."

msgid "发送消息"
msgstr "Send Message"

msgid "发送一条消息，经由 Server酱 推送到微信（或你在 Server酱 后台配置的其它通道）。"
msgstr "Send a message; it is delivered to WeChat (or any other channel configured in your ServerChan console) through ServerChan."

msgid "消息标题"
msgstr "Title"

msgid "消息正文"
msgstr "Content"

msgid "指定通道"
msgstr "Channel"

msgid "短链标题"
msgstr "Short-link title"

msgid "企微成员"
msgstr "WeCom member"

msgid "如 服务器磁盘告警"
msgstr "e.g. Server disk alert"

msgid "支持 Markdown 的正文，如：\n## 告警详情\n\n磁盘使用率 **92%**，请及时清理。"
msgstr "Markdown content, e.g.:\n## Alert details\n\nDisk usage **92%**, please clean up."

msgid "留空则不发送短链"
msgstr "Leave empty to skip the short link"

msgid "多个用 | 分隔"
msgstr "Separate multiple values with |"

msgid "必填：消息标题，最长 32 个字符，不能包含换行"
msgstr "Required: message title, up to 32 characters, no line breaks"

msgid "选填：消息正文，支持 Markdown（订阅会员的卡片可显示全文）"
msgstr "Optional: message content, Markdown supported (paid members' cards can show the full text)"

msgid "选填：本次推送使用的消息通道；不选则用 Server酱 后台「通道配置」页设置的默认通道。需要同时推送到两个通道时，可直接传组合值用 | 分隔（如 9|66）。通道值：方糖服务号=9、企业微信应用消息=66、企业微信群机器人=1、钉钉群机器人=2、飞书群机器人=3、Bark iOS=8、PushDeer=18、官方 Android 版=98、测试号=0、自定义=88。"
msgstr "Optional: the message channel for this push; if not selected, the default channel set on the \"Channel Config\" page of ServerChan is used. To push to two channels at once, pass a combined value separated by | (e.g. 9|66). Channel values: Fangtang WeChat service account=9, WeCom app message=66, WeCom group bot=1, DingTalk group bot=2, Feishu group bot=3, Bark iOS=8, PushDeer=18, official Android client=98, test account=0, custom=88."

# channel 下拉选项（docs/push.py CHANNEL_OPTIONS）
msgid "不指定（用后台设置的默认通道）"
msgstr "Not specified (use the default channel set in ServerChan)"

msgid "方糖服务号（微信）"
msgstr "Fangtang WeChat service account"

msgid "企业微信应用消息"
msgstr "WeCom app message"

msgid "企业微信群机器人"
msgstr "WeCom group bot"

msgid "钉钉群机器人"
msgstr "DingTalk group bot"

msgid "飞书群机器人"
msgstr "Feishu group bot"

msgid "Bark iOS"
msgstr "Bark iOS"

msgid "PushDeer"
msgstr "PushDeer"

msgid "官方 Android 版·β"
msgstr "Official Android client · β"

msgid "测试号"
msgstr "Test account"

msgid "自定义 Webhook"
msgstr "Custom Webhook"

msgid "选填：卡片消息的短链标题"
msgstr "Optional: short-link title for the card message"

msgid "选填：消息标签，多个用 | 分隔"
msgstr "Optional: message tags, separated by |"

msgid "选填：企业微信通道抄送的成员 openid，多个用 | 分隔"
msgstr "Optional: WeCom member openids to copy the message to, separated by |"

msgid "title 最长 32 个字符且不能含换行；desp 支持 Markdown。"
msgstr "title is at most 32 characters with no line breaks; desp supports Markdown."

msgid "SendKey 由服务端托管（控制台「账号管理」→ 平台选「Server酱」、凭据填 SendKey），调用方不传。"
msgstr "The SendKey is hosted server-side (console Account Management → pick the \"ServerChan\" platform and put the SendKey in the credential field); callers do not pass it."

msgid "Server酱 免费账号限制每日 5 条、每分钟 50 条，超限时上游会返回错误码（本接口按外部服务错误返回）。"
msgstr "Free ServerChan accounts are limited to 5 messages per day and 50 per minute; when exceeded, the upstream returns an error code (this API reports it as an external service error)."

msgid "上游返回非 0 时，本接口返回 40001，msg 即上游给的原因。"
msgstr "When the upstream returns a non-zero code, this API returns 40001 with the upstream reason in msg."

msgid "本次推送的消息标识，用于「查询推送状态」"
msgstr "Identifier of this push; use it with the status query endpoint"

msgid "阅读密钥，用于「查询推送状态」与阅读页地址"
msgstr "Read key used for the status query endpoint and the reading page URL"

msgid "本次是否为端对端加密推送（传了 encrypt_password 为 true）"
msgstr "Whether this push is end-to-end encrypted (true when encrypt_password was passed)"

# --- send 新增可选参数：noip / encrypt_password ---
msgid "隐藏调用 IP"
msgstr "Hide caller IP"

msgid "显示调用 IP（默认）"
msgstr "Show caller IP (default)"

msgid "选填：是否隐藏本次调用的来源 IP；选「隐藏」后 Server酱 不记录调用方 IP。"
msgstr "Optional: whether to hide the source IP of this call; when hidden, ServerChan does not record the caller IP."

msgid "阅读密码"
msgstr "Read password"

msgid "留空则不加密"
msgstr "Leave empty to skip encryption"

msgid "选填：填了即对 desp 做端对端加密后再推送，消息在 Server酱 / 微信 侧都是密文；收件人需在消息详情页输入同一密码才能查看内容。密码请另行告知收件人，平台不保存。"
msgstr "Optional: when set, desp is end-to-end encrypted before pushing, so the message stays ciphertext on ServerChan / WeChat; the recipient must enter the same password on the message detail page to read it. Share the password out-of-band — this platform does not store it."

msgid "发送是**异步入队**：返回成功只代表已入队，实际是否送达请用「查询推送状态」接口看 wxstatus。"
msgstr "Sending is **asynchronous**: a successful response only means it was queued. Use the status query endpoint and check wxstatus for actual delivery."

msgid "传了 encrypt_password 即为端对端加密：推送日志里记录的是密文，不是明文正文。"
msgstr "Passing encrypt_password enables end-to-end encryption: the push log stores the ciphertext, not the plaintext content."

# --- 查询推送状态端点 ---
msgid "查询推送状态"
msgstr "Query Push Status"

msgid "用「发送消息」返回的 pushid + readkey，查询这条消息的实际送达结果（wxstatus）。"
msgstr "Use the pushid + readkey returned by \"Send Message\" to check this message's actual delivery result (wxstatus)."

msgid "推送 ID"
msgstr "Push ID"

msgid "来自「发送消息」返回的 pushid"
msgstr "pushid returned by \"Send Message\""

msgid "必填：发送消息返回的 pushid"
msgstr "Required: the pushid returned by the send endpoint"

msgid "阅读密钥"
msgstr "Read key"

msgid "来自「发送消息」返回的 readkey"
msgstr "readkey returned by \"Send Message\""

msgid "必填：发送消息返回的 readkey"
msgstr "Required: the readkey returned by the send endpoint"

msgid "Server酱 的发送是异步入队，发送接口返回成功只代表「已入队」；实际是否送达微信要看本接口的 wxstatus。"
msgstr "ServerChan sends asynchronously: a successful send response only means \"queued\". Whether it actually reached WeChat is shown by wxstatus from this endpoint."

msgid "wxstatus 为空表示该任务可能还没执行，稍后重试即可。"
msgstr "An empty wxstatus means the task may not have run yet; retry later."

msgid "data 为上游的推送详情 JSON，其中 wxstatus 即微信接口返回的内容（为空表示可能还未执行），以实际返回为准。"
msgstr "data is the upstream push-detail JSON; wxstatus is the raw WeChat API result (empty means it may not have run yet). Refer to the actual response."

# --- 控制台推送日志（console_menu.py / console/push_logs.html） ---
msgid "推送日志"
msgstr "Push Logs"

msgid "消息推送服务（当前接入 Server酱）每次推送的记录：标题 / 正文摘要、发起项目、成功或失败、上游返回码与推送ID，便于回看与排错。SendKey 在「账号管理」维护。"
msgstr "Records of every push made by the message push service (currently ServerChan): title / content summary, calling project, success or failure, upstream code and pushid — handy for review and troubleshooting. The SendKey is managed in Account Management."

msgid "推送日志 - 超级管理员 - 小影API"
msgstr "Push Logs - Superadmin - XiaoYingAPI"

msgid "超级管理员,推送日志,消息推送,Server酱"
msgstr "superadmin,push logs,message push,ServerChan"

msgid "小影API 超级管理员：查看消息推送服务每次推送的记录（成功 / 失败、上游返回码与推送ID）。"
msgstr "XiaoYingAPI superadmin: view every push record of the message push service (success / failure, upstream code and pushid)."

msgid "推送由「消息推送服务」写库留痕，本页只读；SendKey 不在本表、也不在此展示。"
msgstr "Pushes are recorded to the database by the message push service; this page is read-only. The SendKey is neither stored in this table nor shown here."

msgid "SendKey 在「账号管理」里新增 platform=Server酱 的账号维护（凭据字段填 SendKey），服务端自动取用。"
msgstr "Maintain the SendKey by adding an account with platform=ServerChan in Account Management (put the SendKey in the credential field); the server picks it up automatically."

msgid "标题 / 正文"
msgstr "Title / content"

msgid "消息"
msgstr "Message"

msgid "上游码"
msgstr "Upstream code"

msgid "推送ID"
msgstr "Push ID"

msgid "暂无推送记录。"
msgstr "No push records yet."

msgid "共 %(total)s 条推送记录；成功与失败都会留痕，失败原因见「说明」列。"
msgstr "%(total)s push record(s); both successes and failures are logged — see the \"Note\" column for failure reasons."
